<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">RRK11.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">2 SAMUELI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Samueli Ekya Kabiri</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samueli</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Sam</para>
  <para style="mt1">EKITABO KYA SAMUELI</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKYA KABIRI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okubikirwa Saulo na Yonasaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 30:17">1 Sam 30:17</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 30:26">26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'okufa kwa Saulo, Daudi akatabaaruka naaruga kwita Abaamaleki; ku yaahikire Zikulaagi, yaamarayo ebiro bibiri. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 4:10">2 Sam 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 4:12">1 Sam 4:12</ref>. </char></note> Aha kiro kya kashatu haija omushaija naaruga omu rusiisira rwa Saulo, emyenda ye etaagukire, aine eitaka omu mutwe; ku yaahikire ahari Daudi, yaajuumara ahansi, yaamutangirira. <verse eid="2SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Daudi yaamubuuza ati: Nooruga hi? Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Naacwa omu rusiisira rw'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="2SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Daudi yaamubuuza ati: Bibaire bita? Ninkweshengyereza, ngambira. Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Abantu bahungire aha rugamba, baingi omuribo bagwire, baafa, kandi Saulo n'omutabani Yonasaani nabo bafiire. <verse eid="2SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Daudi yaabuuza ogwo mutsigazi owaamubikira ati: Beitu shi omanyisiibwe ki Saulo n'omutabani Yonasaani ku bafiire? <verse eid="2SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 10:1-3">1 Bus 10:1-3</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo mutsigazi owaabaire naamubikira yaagira ati: Ku mbaire niinyegyendera, naahika aha kibungo Giliboa, naareeba Saulo ayegamiire eicumu rye; kandi naareeba ab'ebigaari n'ab'embaraasi bamubingire bamuhambize. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Ku agarwire amaisho enyima, yandeeba, yaanyeta, naanye naamwetaba nti: Ndi aha, Nyakusinga! <verse eid="2SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />Yambuuza ati: Ori oha? Naamugarukamu nti: Ndi Omuamaleki. <verse eid="2SA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />Yangira ati: Mpika haihi, onyite; ahakuba nyine obusaasi bwingi, kandi tinkakabire. <verse eid="2SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:54">Bar 9:54</ref>. </char></note> Ntyo naamuhika haihi, naamwita, ahakuba mmanyiire kimwe ku atari w'okukira yaagwire; bwanyima naamucwijura ekirunga ky'aha mutwe gwe n'engoro ebaire emuri aha mukono; mbwenu mbibi, mbikureeteire, mukama wangye. <verse eid="2SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:31">2 Sam 3:31</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 13:31">13:31</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaataagura emyenda ye, n'abashaija boona abu yaabaire aine baakora batyo. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Baacura nibaborooga, baayesiibyakwo okuhitsya omu mwabazyo, ahabwa Saulo n'omutabani Yonasaani, n'ahabw'abantu ba MUKAMA n'enju ya Israeli okumarwa rurara.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Daudi yaabuuza omutsigazi owaamubikira ati: Nooruga hi? Onu ati: Ndi omwana w'omunyaihanga, Omuamaleki. <verse eid="2SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 24:6">1 Sam 24:6</ref>. </char></note> Daudi ati: Kirugire hi iwe okutatiina kubanga omukono kwita ou MUKAMA yaashukireho amajuta? <verse eid="2SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:17">1 Sam 22:17</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 22:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 4:10">2 Sam 4:10</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaayeta omwe aha batsigazi, yaamugira ati: Irooko omuhikye haihi, omugurukire. Yaamucumita, yaafa. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Daudi yaamugira ati: Orubanja rw'eshagama yaawe rube niiwe rwabaho, ahabw'okuba akanwa kaawe niko mushinja ku waahamya noogira oti: Nyitsire ou MUKAMA yaashukireho amajuta.<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekyeshongoro ky'okucurira Saulo na Yonasaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Bwanyima Daudi yaacurira Saulo n'omutabani Yonasaani n'ekyoshongoro eki, <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:13">Yos 10:13</ref>. </char></note> (kandi yaaragiira kukyegyesa Abayuda; reeba kihandiikirwe omu kitabo kya Yashari.) Naagira ati:<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />Ai bambe Israeli, ekitiinisa kyawe kiitiirwe aha bibungo byawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:19">Amamanzi ka gagwire!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 9:54">Bar 9:54</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutakigamba omuri Gaasi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">Mutakibuzya omu mihanda ya Ashikelooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">Abaishiki b'Abafilistia bakeesima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">N'abaishiki b'abatashazirwe bakeehimbisa.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 10:1">1 Sam 10:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe ebibungo bya Giliboa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Mutatondwaho orume, mukaguubwaho enjura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">N'obu kwakuba okugira emisiri y'empongano!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Ahakuba okwo niyo engabo y'emanzi enagirwe kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Engabo ya Saulo, nk'otarashukirweho majuta.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 14:6">1 Sam 14:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obuta bwa Yonasaani bukaba butagaruka nyima</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">Kuruga aha shagama y'abaitsirwe, n'aha mamanzi ebikaaka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">Kandi rurara ya Saulo ekaba etagaruka busha.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />Saulo na Yonasaani bakaba bari barungi kandi abarikukundwa bakiriho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">N'omu kufa kwabo tibataanisiibwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Bakaba barahuka okukira empungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Kandi baine amaani okukira entare.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />Imwe abaishiki ba Israeli mucurire Saulo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:24">Owaabaire abajweka emyenda ya karari erikunekaneka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:24">Akahunda emyenda yaanyu ezaabu.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />Amamanzi ka gagwire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:25">Ahagati y'orugamba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:25">Yonasaani aitiirwe aha bibungo byawe.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 18:1">1 Sam 18:1</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 18:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 20:17">20:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ninshaasha munonga ahabwawe, mwene waitu Yonasaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Okaba onshemeza munonga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Okukunda kwawe ahariinye kukaba kuri okw'okutangaaza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Okukira okukunda kw'abakazi.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />Amamanzi ka gagwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:27">N'eby'okurwanisa ka bicwekyereire!<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Abayuda okwemeka Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 1:1">Bar 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 23:2-9">1 Sam 23:2-9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo Daudi yaayehanuuza ahari MUKAMA naagira ati; Nyinamukye omu rurembo rumwe aha ndembo za Yuda? MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Inamuka. Daudi yaamubuuza ati: Nyinamukye omuri ruuha? Yaamugarukamu ati: Omuri Heburooni. <verse eid="2SA 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Atyo Daudi yainamukayo n'abakazi be bombi, Ahinoamu owa Yezereeli, na Abigaili owaabaire ari muka Nabali owa Karumeeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 27:2">1 Sam 27:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Daudi yainamuka n'abantu abu yaabaire aine, buri muntu n'ab'omu ka ye; baatuura omu ndembo za Heburooni. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:5">2 Sam 5:5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 31:11">1 Sam 31:11</ref>. </char></note> Abayuda baija, baashukiraho okwo Daudi amajuta kuba omugabe w'enju ya Yuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Bwanyima baagambira Daudi ngu, Aba Yabeshi-gileadi nibo baziikire Saulo. <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />Daudi nikwo kubatumaho entumwa naabagira ati: MUKAMA abahe omugisha, ahabw'okuba mugiriire mukama waanyu Saulo embabazi, mwamuziika. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mat 5:44</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu MUKAMA abagirire embabazi, kandi abakorere eby'obwesigwa; naanye ndyabazimuurira ahabw'eby'embabazi ebyo ebi mukozire. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />N'ahabw'ekyo emikono yaanyu egire amaani, mube amamanzi; ahakuba Saulo mukama waanyu afiire, kandi ab'enju ya Yuda banshukireho amajuta kuba omugabe waabo.<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abagaragwa ba Saulo okurwana n'aba Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 14:50">1 Sam 14:50</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 17:55">17:55</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu bunaku obwo Abuneeri mwene Neeri, omukuru w'engabo za Saulo, akaba atwaire Isheboshesi, mwene Saulo, amwambukize Mahanaimu, <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />amwemekire kuba omugabe wa Gileadi na Ashura na Yezereeli na Efuraimu na Benyamiini na Israeli yoona. <verse eid="2SA 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Kandi Isheboshesi mwene Saulo akaba ahikize emyaka makumi ana obu yaaza aha ngoma kutegyeka Israeli, yaamara aha ngoma emyaka ebiri. Kwonka enju ya Yuda yaakurata Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Omwanya ogu Daudi yaamazire Heburooni ari aha ngoma naategyeka enju ya Yuda gukahika emyaka mushanju n'ameezi mukaaga.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Bwanyima Abuneeri mwene Neeri, n'abagaragwa ba Isheboshesi mwene Saulo, baaruga Mahanaimu, baaza Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Na Yoabu mwene Zeruiya n'abagaragwa ba Daudi baashohora, baabugabugana nabo aha kiyanja kya Gibeoni; abamwe baashutama seeri yaacyo, abandi seenu. <verse eid="2SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Abuneeri yaagira Yoabu ati: Abatsigazi baimukye, batuzaanire. Yoabu yaamugarukamu ati: Nibaimukye. <verse eid="2SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Batyo baimuka, baayambuka, baababara; ab'orubaju rwa Benyamiini na Isheboshesi mwene Saulo baaba ikumi na babiri, kandi ab'orubaju rwa Daudi nabo baaba ikumi na babiri. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Buri omwe yaagwa omuzigu we omu maraka, yaamutimbura rurara omu rubaju; boona baagwera kyarimwe, baafa. Nikyo omwanya ogwo gwayeteirwe Helukasi-hazurimu, oguri haihi na Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Eryo izooba orugamba rwaba orw'amaani munonga; Abuneeri n'abashaija ba Israeli baasingurwa abagaragwa ba Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 2:16">1 Bus 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 12:8">12:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi batabani ba Zeruiya bonshatu, Yoabu, Abishai na Asaheeli, bakaba bariyo; kandi Asaheeli ogwo akaba atarikwiruka, akaba ari esirabo. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Bwanyima Asaheeli yaakurata Abuneeri amubingire; kandi omu kumubinga tiyaareeba ha rubaju rwa buryo nari orwa bumosho kuteishuka Abuneeri. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Abuneeri ku yaareebire enyima, yaagira ati: Biri niiwe, Asaheeli? Onu ati: Niinye. <verse eid="2SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Abuneeri yaamugira ati: Kikaama, otoore aha rubaju rwawe rwa buryo nari orwa bumosho, okwate omwe aha batsigazi, obe niwe waanyaga eby'okurwanisa. Kwonka Asaheeli yaayanga kumurugaho. <verse eid="2SA 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Abuneeri yaagaruka yaagira Asaheeli ati: Toora ahandi orekye kunkurata; mbwenu ku naakucumita, naakutuura aha, okaazira ki? Kandi nkaareebana nta na Yoabu mwene sho? <verse eid="2SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:27">2 Sam 3:27</ref>. </char></note> Nabwo hoona yaayanga kumurugaho; nikyo Abuneeri yaamuteereire omuhunda gw'eicumu rye aha nda, gukamwogamu, akeetuura ahansi, akagwaho; kandi abantu boona ku baabaire bahika ahu Asaheeli yaabaire agwire, beemereraho.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Kwonka Yoabu na Abishai baagyenda, babingire Abuneeri; eizooba ku ryabaire nirirengarenga, baahika aha kibungo Amma ekishungaine na Giya omu muhanda ogurikuza omu ihamba rya Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Ababenyamiini baayeteeranira ahari Abuneeri, baaba omutwe gumwe, baayemerera aha mutwe gw'ekibungo. <verse eid="2SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Bwanyima Abuneeri yaayeta Yoabu, yaamubuuza ati: Rurara eryaguma neerya busha obutoosha? Torikumanya omuheru gw'ekyo ku guriba okushaarira? Mbwenu oryahitsya hi okutaragiira bantu baawe kureka kukuratirira beene waabo? <verse eid="2SA 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 17:14">Enf 17:14</ref>. </char></note> Yoabu yaamugarukamu ati: Nindahira Ruhanga otahwaho, kuri noogira ngu tiwaagamba ekyo kigambo, buzimazima abantu baaba nibaija kuseesa ekiro, buri muntu akuratiriire mwene ishe. <verse eid="2SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Atyo Yoabu yaateera enzamba, abantu boona baayemerera, tibaagumizamu kukuratirira Abaisraeli, n'obu kwakuba okubarwanisa obundi.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Abuneeri n'engabo ze baagyenda ekiro kyona, baaraba omuri Araba, baayambuka Yorudani, baahika Mahanaimu. <verse eid="2SA 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Yoabu yaatabaaruka, yaareka kukuratirira Abuneeri; ku yaaherize kuteeranira abantu boona hamwe, yaashanga omu bagaragwa ba Daudi nihaburamu abantu ikumi na mwenda, otabariiremu Asaheeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Kwonka abagaragwa ba Daudi bakaba baitsire omu Babenyamiini engabo za Abuneeri magana ashatu na makumi mukaaga. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Bwanyima baatwara Asaheeli, baamuziika Betelehemu omu kituuro kya ishe. Kandi Yoabu, n'engabo ze baaraara nibagyenda, bwasheesha baahika Heburooni.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Bwanyima haabaho obweme buhango ahagati y'enju ya Saulo n'eya Daudi; kwonka Daudi yaaguma naayeyongyera amaani, enju ya Saulo yo yaagyenda neehwa amaani.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 3:1">1 Bus 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 25:43">1 Sam 25:43</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Daudi yaazaarira Heburooni abaana b'aboojo; ow'omujigaijo akaba ari Amunooni, ou yaazaire ahari Ahinoamu owa Yezereeli; <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:37">2 Sam 13:37</ref>. </char></note> owa kabiri Kileaba owa Abigaili, owaabaire ari muka Nabali owa Karumeeli; owa kashatu Abusalomu ou yaazaire ahari Maaka omuhara wa Talumai, omugabe wa Geshuri; <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:5">1 Bag 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:13-25">2:13-25</ref>. </char></note> owa kana Adoniya mutabani wa Hagisi; owa kataano Shefatia mutabani wa Abitaali; <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />kandi owa mukaaga akaba ari Itereamu owa Egula muka Daudi. Abo boona nibo Daudi yaazaariire Heburooni.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abuneeri okwangana na Isheboshesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 2:8">2 Sam 2:8</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 2:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obweme ku bwabaire bukiri ahagati y'enju ya Saulo n'eya Daudi, Abuneeri yaayehindura ow'amaani omu nju ya Saulo. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:8">2 Sam 21:8</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 21:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo hakaba hariho omukazi orikwetwa Rizipa, muhara wa Ayiya, owaabaire ari omukazi wa Saulo w'ekinyanshunju. Eizooba rimwe Isheboshesi yaagira Abuneeri ati: Ahabw'enki otembire ekitabo kya muka tata? <verse eid="2SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Okuruga aho Abuneeri yaagira ekiniga ahabw'ebigambo ebi Isheboshesi yaamugambira, yaamugarukamu ati: Beitu shi onyetsire omutwe gw'embwa y'Abayuda? Okuhitsya hati ninkiha enju ya sho Saulo ekitiinisa, na beene ishe na bagyenzi be, kandi tinkakuhayoga mu mikono ya Daudi; haza eri izooba oza kuntaho ekibi ky'okuraara n'ogwo mukazi? <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:28">1 Sam 15:28</ref>. </char></note> Nyowe Abuneeri, ku ndaabe ntakoreire Daudi nk'oku MUKAMA yaamurahiire, <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />nkaiha obugabe aha nju ya Saulo, nkata Daudi aha kitebe ky'obugabe, akategyeka Israeli na Yuda, okuruga Daani okuhika Beeri-sheba, Ruhanga akinture n'okukiraho. <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Isheboshesi tiyaabaasa kugarukamu Abuneeri kigambo kyona, ahabw'okumutiina.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Bwanyima Abuneeri yaatuma entumwa ahari Daudi, ari Heburooni, naagira ati: Mukama w'ensi egi n'oha? Ragaana naanye endagaano, nkwatanise naiwe, nkukubuurire Israeli yoona. <verse eid="2SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:20">1 Sam 18:20</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaamugarukamu ati: Ni kirungi; niinyija kuragaana naiwe endagaano; kwonka eki ndikwenda ahariiwe ni kimwe. Omanye ku otarincwa ryera, kureka biri waabanza kundeetera Mikaali muhara wa Saulo, oizire kundeeba. <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:25">1 Sam 18:25</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 18:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Daudi yaatuma entumwa ahari Isheboshesi mwene Saulo, naagira ati: Mpa omukazi wangye Mikaali, ou naajugire ebishushu igana by'Abafilistia. <verse eid="2SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Isheboshesi nikwo kumutuma, akamwaka iba Palutieli, mwene Laishi. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Kwonka iba yaagyenda naarira omuhanda gwona, amukuratiire, okuhitsya obu baahikire Bahurimu. Abuneeri yaamugira ati: Garukayo. Onu yaagarukayo.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoabu okuhoorera Asaheeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Bwanyima Abuneeri yaagira enaama n'abakuru ba Israeli, naagira ati: Obunaku obwahingwire, mukaba nimwenda Daudi ngu abe omugabe waanyu. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Mbwenu mukikore; ahakuba MUKAMA akaraganisa Daudi naagira ati: Omukono gw'omugaragwa wangye Daudi nigwo ndijunisa abantu bangye Israeli okuruga omu mikono y'Abafilistia, n'okuruga omu mikono y'abazigu baabo boona. <verse eid="2SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 12:29">1 Bus 12:29</ref>. </char></note> Abuneeri yaagaruka yaabigambira Ababenyamiini; kandi yaaza Heburooni kugambira Daudi byona ebi Israeli n'ab'enju ya Benyamiini yoona basiimire kukora.<verse eid="2SA 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Atyo Abuneeri n'abashaija makumi abiri baashanga Daudi Heburooni. Daudi yaateekyera Abuneeri obugyenyi n'abashaija abu yaabaire aine. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Abuneeri yaagira Daudi ati: Niinyija kwimuka, nteeranire Abaisraeli boona ahari mukama wangye omugabe, baragaane naiwe endagaano, obone kutegyeka abu omutima gwawe gurikwenda boona. Atyo Daudi yaayohereza Abuneeri; yaagyenda n'obusingye.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Ago maguru abagaragwa ba Daudi na Yoabu, abaabaire bahurwire, baatabaaruka n'eminyago mingi; kwonka baashanga Abuneeri atakiri na Daudi, ahakuba akaba yaamwohereize, yayengyendeire n'obusingye. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Yoabu ku yaahikire aho, naatabaaruka n'engabo ze zoona ezi yaabaire aine, baamugira bati: Abuneeri mwene Neeri aizire ow'omugabe; yaamwohereza, yaagyenda n'obusingye. <verse eid="2SA 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Atyo Yoabu yaaza ow'omugabe, yaamubuuza ati: Eki okozire ki? Abuneeri mwene okwija owaawe, okamureka akagyenda? <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Kub 27:17</ref>. </char></note> Omanyire kimwe Abuneeri mwene Neeri ku aizire kukubeihabeiha, n'okukutata ngu amanye oku ohurura n'oku otabaaruka, n'okwetegyereza ebi orikukora byona. <verse eid="2SA 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Yoabu ku yaarugire owa Daudi kutabaara, yaatuma entumwa, zaakurata Abuneeri, zaamugarurira aha iziba rya Siira; kwonka Daudi atarikukimanya. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:5">1 Bag 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 20:9">2 Sam 20:9</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 20:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Abuneeri ku yaagarukire Heburooni, Yoabu yaamutwara hangahari omu irembo ahagati, ngu agambe nawe omu mubonano; ku baahikireho, yaamuteera aha nda, yaamugwisaho naamuhoorera eshagama y'omurumuna Asaheeli. <verse eid="2SA 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Daudi ku yaakihuriire, yaagira ati: Nyowe n'engoma yangye titurigiibwaho rubanja rw'eshagama ya Abuneeri mwene Neeri omu maisho ga Ruhanga okuhitsya ebiro byona. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:32">1 Bag 2:32</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 2:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 7:16">Zab 7:16</ref>. </char></note> Kureka ruryaguma ahari Yoabu n'aha ka ya ishe; kandi eka ye teribura kubamu orikurugwamu amahira, nari omubembe, nari okugyendera aha kibango, nari ow'okwitwa rurara, nari omukuuhuzi. <verse eid="2SA 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Okwo nikwo Yoabu na Abishai baitsire Abuneeri, nibamuhoorera murumuna waabu ou yaitiire omu rugamba rwa Gibeoni.<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi okuririra Abuneeri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:34">Kut 37:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Daudi yaagambira Yoabu n'abantu boona abu yaabaire aine ati: Mutaagure ebijwaro byanyu, mwezirikye ebiguniya, mucurire Abuneeri. Kandi omugabe Daudi yaagyenda akuratiire akatanda. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Baaziika Abuneeri Heburooni; omugabe yaimutsya eiraka rye, yaacurira aha kituuro kya Abuneeri; n'abantu boona baacura. <verse eid="2SA 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 2:15">Mub 2:15</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 2:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaacurira Abuneeri, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">Abuneeri akaafiire nk'omushema?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Emikono yaawe tebohirwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">N'ebigyere byawe tibikomirwe na byoma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">Nk'omuntu oku agwa omu maisho g'ababi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">Naiwe nikwo ofiire.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 3:34">N'abantu boona baagaruka baamucurira. <verse eid="2SA 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:17">2 Sam 12:17</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abantu boona baija kweshengyereza Daudi kurya ak'okurya bukiri kare; kwonka yaarahira naagira ati: Ku ndaarye aha mugaati nari ekindi kyona, izooba ritakarengire, Ruhanga akinture n'okukiraho. <verse eid="2SA 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Abantu boona baakyetegyereza, kyabashemeza; kandi ebi omugabe yaabaire akora byona bikaba bishemeza abantu boona. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />N'ahabw'ekyo aha izooba eryo abantu boona n'Abaisraeli boona baamanya ku kitarugire ha mugabe kwita Abuneeri mwene Neeri. <verse eid="2SA 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Omugabe yaagira abagaragwa be ati: Ebyo nimumanya hati omuri Israeli ku hafiiremu omunyiginya, kandi obaire ari omushaija rugambwa? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:7">2 Sam 19:7</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 19:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:5">1 Bag 2:5</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 2:6">6</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 2:33">33</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 2:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 28:4">Zab 28:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nyowe, n'obu ndaabe ndi omugabe oshukirweho amajuta, kwonka ndi busha; n'abashaija aba, batabani ba Zeruiya, bagumire, tindikubabaasa. MUKAMA azimuurire enkozi y'ebibi nk'obubi bwayo oku buri.<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Bwanyima Isheboshesi mwene Saulo ku yaahurire ngu Abuneeri agwire Heburooni, emikono ye yaahwa amaani, n'Abaisraeli boona baashoberwa. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Kandi Isheboshesi ogwo mutabani wa Saulo akaba aine abakuru b'engabo ze babiri; omwe akaba naayetwa Baana, n'ondiijo ari Rekabu, beene Rimona owa Beeroosi, ow'omu ruganda rwa Benyamiini; (ahakuba Beeroosi ekaba neebarirwa ahari Benyamiini; <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />kandi aba Beeroosi bakahungira Gitaimu, baashuhuukirayo n'okuhitsya hati).<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 9:3">2 Sam 9:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Yonasaani mwene Saulo akaba aine omwana oremaire ebigyere. Obu omubiki yaaruga Yezereeli kubika Saulo na Yonasaani, ogwo mwana akaba ahikize emyaka etaano. Omurezi we yaamubakura, yaahunga; ku yaabaire nairuka nawe naahunga, yaamusyoka omu mikono, yaagwa ahansi, yaaremara. Eiziina ry'ogwo mwana akaba naayetwa Mefiboshesi.<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Isheboshesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Eizooba rimwe beene Rimona owa Beeroosi, Rekabu na Baana bakaija, baahika owa Isheboshesi omu ihangwe, baashanga abyami ahuumwireho; <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:25">Bar 5:25</ref>. </char></note> kandi omurinzi w'enju owaabaire naashemeza engano, baashanga yaakwatwa oturo, yaagwejegyera. N'ahabw'ekyo Rekabu na Baana omurumuna baataahamu. <verse eid="2SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Ku baahikire omu nju, baashanga Isheboshesi abyami aha kitanda kye omu kishengye ky'okuraaramu, baamucumita, baamwita, baamutemaho omutwe. Baagutwara, baagyenda ekiro kyona nibatoora omuhanda ogw'omuri Araba. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 23:15">1 Sam 23:15</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo mutwe gwa Isheboshesi baagutwarira Daudi Heburooni, baagira omugabe bati: Ngugu omutwe gwa Isheboshesi mwene Saulo omuzigu waawe, owaabaire akuhiiga kukwita. Eri izooba MUKAMA yaahoorera mukama waitu omugabe Saulo n'oruzaaro rwe. <verse eid="2SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:29">1 Bag 1:29</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:4">Zab 103:4</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagarukamu, naagira Rekabu na Baana omurumuna beene Rimona owa Beeroosi, ati: Nindahira MUKAMA otahwaho, owaakirize amagara gangye omu kabi koona, <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:2">2 Sam 1:2</ref>. </char></note> obu omuntu yaija, akangira ati: Reeba, Saulo afiire; akaba naagira ngu andeeteire enkuru nungu; ahonaaho naamukwata, naamwita Zikulaagi; ebyo nibyo bihembo ebi naamuhaire ahabw'enkuru ze. <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:5">Kut 9:5</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 9:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu shi, nk'abantu babi abaitira ohikiriire omu nju ye abyami aha kitanda, nimugira ngu tindikwija kubahoorera eshagama ye, nkabacwekyereza, nkabaiha omu nsi, okukira ogwo? <verse eid="2SA 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:15">2 Sam 1:15</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Daudi yaaragiira abatsigazi be, baabaita, baabatemaho engaro n'ebigyere, baabahanika aha rubaju rw'eiziba rya Heburooni. Kandi omutwe gwa Isheboshesi baagutwara, baaguziika omu kituuro kya Abuneeri Heburooni.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okuba omugabe wa Israeli yoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 19:12">2 Sam 19:12</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 19:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima enganda zoona eza Israeli zaashanga Daudi Heburooni; zaamugira ziti: Reeba, turi abaanyu ab'aha mara. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:13">1 Sam 18:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:71">Zab 78:71</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro ebyahingwire, obu Saulo yaabaire ari omugabe waitu, niiwe waabaire oyebembera Abaisraeli nibahurura kandi nibatabaaruka; kandi MUKAMA akakugira ati: Niiwe oririisa abantu bangye Israeli, kandi niiwe oriba omugabe waabo. <verse eid="2SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 11:3">1 Bus 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 11:17">2 Bag 11:17</ref>. </char></note> Batyo abakuru ba Israeli boona baashanga omugabe Daudi Heburooni; kandi okwo niyo yaaraganiire nabo endagaano omu maisho ga MUKAMA, bakamushukaho amajuta kuba omugabe wa Israeli. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Kandi Daudi, obu yaaza aha ngoma, akaba ahikize emyaka makumi ashatu, yaamara emyaka makumi ana ari aha ngoma. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Omuri Heburooni akamaramu emyaka mushanju n'ameezi mukaaga naategyeka Yuda; kandi omuri Yerusaalemu yaamaramu emyaka makumi ashatu n'eshatu, naategyeka Israeli yoona na Yuda.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi okukubuura Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 1:21">Bar 1:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe yaimuka n'engabo ze, baaza Yerusaalemu, baarwanisa aba Yebusi, abatuuzi b'omuri egyo nsi, abaagizire Daudi bati: Ku oriba otamazireho mpumi n'ebirema, torihika aha; ahabw'okuba bakaba niba teekateeka ngu Daudi tarikubaasa kuhikayo. <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />N'obu kiraabe kyabaire kityo, Daudi akakwata ekigo kya Saayuuni, nirwo rurembo rwa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Kandi ahari eryo izooba Daudi akaba agizire ati: Orikwenda kuteera aba Yebusi, atembe ahu amaizi garikwerekyerera, abone kwita biri birema n'empumi, ebi Daudi arikwanga. Nikyo bagirira bati: Empumi n'ebirema bitaritaaha omu nju. <verse eid="2SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:5">2 Bus 32:5</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Daudi yaatuura omuri ekyo kigo, yaakyeta orurembo rwa Daudi. Yaakyombekaho amaju okukyehinguririza, okuruga Miilo n'okugaruka omunda. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Daudi yaaguma naayeyongyera kugira ekitiinisa; ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga ow'amahe akaba ari hamwe nawe.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 14:1">1 Bus 14:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Hiraamu omugabe wa Tuuro yaayohereza entumwa ahari Daudi n'ebiti by'emyereezi, n'ababaizi n'abarikwombekyesa amabaare; baayombekyera Daudi enju. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:11">2 Bus 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="EST 4:14">Est 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaamanyira aho ku MUKAMA amuhamize kuba omugabe wa Israeli, kandi ku aimukize obugabe bwe ahabw'abantu be Israeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 17:17">Bir 17:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Daudi ku yaarugire Heburooni, yaahika Yerusaalemu, yaashwererayo ebindi binyanshunju n'abandi bakazi; kandi baamuzaarira abandi baana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Aga nigo maziina g'abaana abu baamuzaariire ari Yerusaalemu– Shamua, Shobabu, Nasani, Sulemaani, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />Ibuhaari, Elishua, Nefegi, Yafia, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />Elishaama, Eliada na Elifeleti.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi okugaruka kusingura Abafilistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Abafilistia ku baahuriire ngu Daudi ashukirweho amajuta kuba omugabe w'Abaisraeli, boona baimuka, baaza kusherura Daudi. Daudi ku yaabihuriire, yaashuuma, yaaza omu kigo. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Omu bunaku obwo Abafilistia bakaba baizire, bajanjaire oruhita rw'Abareefa rwona. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:21">Kub 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 2:1">2 Sam 2:1</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaayehanuuza ahari MUKAMA naabuuza ati: Nyinamukye, ndwane n'Abafilistia? Noija kubahayo omu mikono yangye? MUKAMA yaagarukamu Daudi ati: Inamuka, ahakuba buzimazima niinyija kuhayo Abafilistia omu mikono yaawe. <verse eid="2SA 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Atyo Daudi yaaza Baali-peraziimu, yaabaitirayo. Bwanyima yaagira ati: MUKAMA ahigwire abazigu bangye omu maisho gangye, nk'oku amaizi gahigura omucungiro. Nikyo yaayeteire ogwo mwanya Baali-peraziimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Abafilistia baatsigayo ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa, Daudi n'abashaija be baabitwara.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Ku haahingwire ebiro, Abafilistia baagaruka bainamuka, baajanjaara oruhita rw'Abareefa. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Daudi ku yaayehanwize ahari MUKAMA, MUKAMA yaamugarukamu ati: Otainamukayo; kureka obakiikuukye, obareetwe enyima ahashungaine n'akabira k'emitugunda. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Bwanyima ku oraahurire enshwagara aha mitwe y'emitugunda, ahonaaho oyehuute, ahabw'okuba obwo MUKAMA naaba akwebembeire kuteera engabo z'Abafilistia. <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Daudi yaatwaza nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiira, yaagyenda naita Abafilistia okuruga Geeba, okuhika Gezeri.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okugarura eshanduukye ya Ruhanga omu rurembo rwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1-11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 13:1-14">1 Bus 13:1-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Daudi yaagaruka yaateerana engabo zoona ezitoorainwe omuri Israeli, abantu obukumi bushatu. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Kur 25:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 80:1">Zab 80:1</ref>. </char></note> Yaimuka, yaagyenda n'ezo ngabo zoona ezi yaabaire aine, baaza Baale eya Yuda, kwihayo eshanduukye ya Ruhanga, erikwetererwa Eiziina rya MUKAMA ow'amahe, oshutama ahari baakerubi. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 6:7">1 Sam 6:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 7:1">7:1</ref>. </char></note> Baatwarira eshanduukye ya Ruhanga aha kigaari kisya; baagiiha omu ka ya Abinadabu eyaabaire eri aha kibungo; kandi Uzaa na Ahio batabani ba Abinadabu nibo baabaire nibatwara ekyo kigaari kisya, <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />ekyabaire kiriho eshanduukye ya Ruhanga, Ahio agyebembeire. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 150:3-5">Zab 150:3-5</ref>. </char></note> Daudi n'ab'enju ya Israeli boona baagyenda nibashemererwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA, nibeeshongora n'amaani gaabo goona, nibateera endingiri, n'enanga n'engarabi n'amataari n'ebitaasa.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 4:15">Kub 4:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baahikire aha mbuga ya Nakoni, Uzza yaatayo omukono gwe, yaaramira eshanduukye ya Ruhanga, ahabw'okuba ente zikateera entsibo. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 6:19">1 Sam 6:19</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagirira Uzaa ekiniga; Ruhanga yaamwitira aho, naamutura okuramira eshanduukye n'omukono gwe; yaafeera aho aha rubaju rw'eshanduukye ya Ruhanga. <verse eid="2SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Daudi yaaguubwa kubi ahabwa MUKAMA kugwa ahari Uzaa; omwanya ogwo yaagweta Pereezi-uzaa, n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="2SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Eryo izooba Daudi yaatiina MUKAMA, yaagira ati: Mbwenu eshanduukye ya MUKAMA neebaasa eta kuza owangye? <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:25">1 Bus 15:25</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo Daudi yaayanga kwihayo eshanduukye ya MUKAMA kugitwara owe omu rurembo rwa Daudi; yaagikiikamya, yaagitaasya omu nju ya Obededomu owa Gaasi. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:4">1 Bus 26:4</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 26:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Eshanduukye ya MUKAMA yaamara ameezi ashatu omu nju ya Obededomu owa Gaasi; MUKAMA yaamuha omugisha n'ab'omu ka ye boona.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12-19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 15:25-16:3">1 Bus 15:25—16:3</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:1">1 Bag 8:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima baagambira omugabe Daudi bati: MUKAMA ahaire eka ya Obededomu omugisha n'ebi aine byona ahabw'eshanduukye ya Ruhanga. N'ahabw'ekyo Daudi yaagyenda, yaiha eshanduukye ya Ruhanga omu nju ya Obededomu, yaagiinamura omu rurembo rwa Daudi n'okushemererwa. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:2">1 Bus 15:2</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 15:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 4:15">Kub 4:15</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo byatwaziibwe; abaheekire eshanduukye ya MUKAMA ku baagyenzireho entambwe mukaaga, Daudi yaatambiraho enimi y'ekimasha n'enyana y'ebishaju. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:18">1 Sam 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 30:11">Zab 30:11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:20">Kur 15:20</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaayemurikira omu maisho ga MUKAMA n'amaani ge goona, ayezirikire efodi ya kitaani. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Atyo Daudi n'ab'enju ya Israeli boona bainamura eshanduukye ya MUKAMA, nibateera akaari n'amakondere.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Bwanyima eshanduukye ya MUKAMA ku yaabaire neetaaha omu rurembo rwa Daudi, Mikaali muhara wa Saulo yaaringuririza omu dirisa, yaareeba omugabe Daudi naayemurika kandi naazinira omu maisho ga MUKAMA, yamugayira aha mutima. <verse eid="2SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:1">1 Bus 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:8">Zab 132:8</ref>. </char></note> Baataasya eshanduukye ya MUKAMA, baagita omu mwanya gwayo omu ihema eri Daudi agiteereireho; Daudi yaatamba ebitambo by'okwotsya n'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Kandi ku yaaherize kutamba ebyo bitambo by'okwotsya n'ezo mpongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, yaashabira abantu omugisha omu iziina rya MUKAMA ow'amahe, <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />yaagaburira abantu boona, ab'eihanga ryona erya Israeli, abashaija n'abakazi, buri muntu omugaati, entongo y'enyama n'omwate gw'emizaabibu eyomire. Okuruga aho abantu boona baarugayo, buri muntu yaataaha owe.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 7:16">Mub 7:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Daudi yaagarukayo kushabira ab'omu ka ye omugisha. Mikaali muhara wa Saulo yaashohora kubugana Daudi, yaagira ati: Eshi eri izooba omugabe wa Israeli yaagira ekitiinisa, obu yaaba naayejwekyera busha omu maisho g'abazaana b'abairu be, nk'omuntu otaine ku ari oku ayejweka busha ataine nshoni! <verse eid="2SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:15">1 Sam 13:15</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:28">15:28</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagarukamu Mikaali ati: Ekyo naakikorera omu maisho ga MUKAMA owantooraine akanyeshumbya sho n'ab'omu ka ye boona, akangira omugabe w'abantu be Israeli; nikyo ndigumira niinyemurikira omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Kandi niinyija kwongyera kwehindura orikugaywa okukira aho, n'okwegarura ahansi omu maisho gaawe; kwonka abo bazaana abu waagambaho, bo baryampa ekitiinisa. <verse eid="2SA 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Okuruga aho Mikaali muhara wa Saulo tiyaagira bu azaara okuhitsya aha izooba eri yaafeereireho.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuraganisa Daudi ku arihamya obugabe bwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1-29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 17:1-27">1 Bus 17:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 12:1">2 Sam 12:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo omugabe yaaguma omu ka ye, kandi MUKAMA yaamuha okuhuumura abazigu be boona embaju zoona. <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:1">Kur 26:1</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:11">2 Sam 5:11</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omugabe yaagira nabi Nasani ati: Reeba hati, ndi omu nju y'emyereezi, kwonka eshanduukye ya Ruhanga eri omu ihema. <verse eid="2SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:17">1 Bag 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 22:7">1 Bus 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 28:2">28:2</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:46">Byak 7:46</ref>. </char></note> Nasani yaagira omugabe ati: Irooko okore ekikuri aha mutima kyona, ahakuba MUKAMA ari hamwe naiwe.<verse eid="2SA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Ekyo kiro ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaizira Nasani nikigira kiti: <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />Irooko ogambire omwiru wangye Daudi oti: MUKAMA naagira ati: Ebyo oryanyombekyera enju y'okutaahamu? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:34">Kur 40:34</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:16">1 Bag 8:16</ref>. </char></note> Noomanya ku ntakatuuragu mu nju, okwiha obu naiha Abaisraeli Misiri n'okuhitsya hati, kureka nkaba ngyendagyenda nintaaha omu ihema. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:11">Lev 26:11</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:14">Bir 23:14</ref>. </char></note> Nimugira ngu omu myanya yoona ei naabaire ngyendamu n'Abaisraeli boona, nkaba ndagizire omwe aha baramuzi ba Israeli, abu naaragiire kuriisa abantu bangye Israeli nti: Ahabw'enki mutakanyombekyeraga nju y'emyereezi? <verse eid="2SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:11">1 Sam 16:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:70">Zab 78:70</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ogire omwiru wangye Daudi oti: MUKAMA ow'amahe naagira ati: Nkakwiha omu iriisizo nooriisa entaama, ngu nkuhindure omutegyeki w'abantu bangye Israeli, <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:10">2 Sam 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 8:6">8:6</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 8:14">14</ref>. </char></note> kandi nkaba nguma naiwe ahu waabaire oza hoona, ncwekyerereza abazigu baawe omu maisho gaawe; kandi ndyakuha eiziina rikuru nk'ery'abantu rugambwa ab'omu nsi. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:8">2 Bag 21:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 80:8">Zab 80:8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:15">Amo 9:15</ref>. </char></note> Ndyatooranira abantu bangye Israeli omwanya, mbabyaremu, babone kugira obutaka bw'okutuuramu, obu batariihwamu bundi. Kandi abantu babi tibarigaruka kubaita kubi nk'obunyakare, <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:11-16">Bar 2:11-16</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:38">1 Bag 11:38</ref>. </char></note> obu naabaire ndagiira abaramuzi kutegyeka abantu bangye Israeli; kandi ndyakuha okuhuumura abazigu baawe boona. N'ekindi, MUKAMA naakugambira ku arikuhindura oruganda.<verse eid="2SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 2:1">1 Bag 2:1</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 2:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:20">8:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:11">Zab 132:11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:36">Byak 13:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi obunaku bwawe ku burihika, waagwejegyera, waashanga baashwenkuru, ndyayemeka omwana waawe ou oryezaarira, akuhungurire, kandi mpamye obugabe bwe. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:5">1 Bag 5:5</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 22:10">1 Bus 22:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:4">Zab 89:4</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 89:29">29</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 89:36">36</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 89:37">37</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo niwe aryombekyera eiziina ryangye enju; kandi ndyahamya ekitebe ky'obugabe bwe ebiro byona. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:26">Zab 89:26</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 89:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:5">Heb 1:5</ref>. </char></note> Ndyaba ishe, nawe abe omwana wangye; ku aricumura, ndyamuhanisa enkoni z'abantu, babe nibo baamuteera; <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:23">1 Sam 15:23</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 15:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:13">1 Bag 11:13</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:34">34</ref>. </char></note> kwonka embabazi zangye tizirimurugaho, nk'oku naaziihire ahari Saulo, ou naacwire nkaiha omu maisho gaawe. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Enju yaawe n'obugabe bwawe biryahamibwa ebiro byona, n'ekitebe ky'obugabe bwawe kiryaba eky'ebiro byona. <verse eid="2SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Ebyo bigambo byona n'okwo kworekwa kwona, Nasani yaabiteekyerereza Daudi nk'oku byabaire biri.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okushaba kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Bwanyima Daudi omugabe yaataaha omu Ihema, yaashutama omu maisho ga MUKAMA, yaagira ati: Niinye oha, ai MUKAMA Ruhanga? Kandi n'enju yangye nikyo ki, iwe okundinda okampitsya aha? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Kwonka ekyo ahariiwe ni kikye, MUKAMA Ruhanga; mbwenu waayongyeraho n'okugamba aha by'enju y'omwiru waawe, oku eriba omu biro bingi munonga ebiriija, nk'oku kiba omu biragiro by'abantu, ai MUKAMA Ruhanga. <verse eid="2SA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 139:1-4">Zab 139:1-4</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu shi, ekindi Daudi akugambire ki? Ahabw'okuba noomanya omwiru waawe, MUKAMA Ruhanga. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Ahabw'endagaano yaawe okakora ebikuru ebyo byona, kubimanyisa omwiru waawe, nk'oku omutima gwawe gwateekateekire. <verse eid="2SA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:11">Kur 15:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 16:25">1 Bus 16:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:10">Zab 86:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:4">96:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:6">Yer 10:6</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 8:5">1 Kor 8:5</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 8:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo obeera mukuru, MUKAMA Ruhanga; ahakuba tihariho orikushushana naiwe, kandi tihariho Ruhanga ondiijo kureka Iwe, nk'ebi twahuriire byona oku biri. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:51">Kur 12:51</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:7">Bir 4:7</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 4:34">34</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ni ihanga ki omu nsi eriri nk'abantu baawe Israeli, abu Ruhanga yaagiire kwecungurira kuba abantu be, ngu ayetungire eiziina, ahabw'okubakorera ebikuru kandi ebirikutiinisa, naabinga omu maisho gaabo eihanga na baaruhanga baaryo? <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 26:18">Bir 26:18</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima okeehamiza abantu baawe Israeli, ngu babe eihnaga eri waayetooraniire ebiro byona; naiwe, MUKAMA, okaba Ruhanga waabo. <verse eid="2SA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />Mbwenu hati, MUKAMA Ruhanga, ekigambo eki waagamba aha mwiru waawe n'aha nju ye, okihamye ebiro byona, kandi okore nk'oku waagamba; <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />n'eiziina ryawe riryahimbisibwa ebiro byona, bagire bati: MUKAMA ow'amahe niwe Ruhanga wa Israeli; kandi enju y'omwiru waawe Daudi eryahamibwa omu maisho gaawe. <verse eid="2SA 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Ahakuba Iwe, MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, oshuuruuriire omwiru waawe, noogira oti: Ndyakwombekyera enju; nikyo omwiru waawe agiriire obumanzi bw'okukushaba ebigambo ebi. <verse eid="2SA 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:17">Yoh 17:17</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu hati, ai MUKAMA Ruhanga, niiwe Ruhanga, n'ebigambo byawe n'eby'amazima, kandi oraganiise omwiru waawe, ekigambo ekyo ekirungi. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:28">Zab 89:28</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 89:29">29</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo hati ikiriza kuha enju y'omwiru waawe omugisha, egumeho ebiro byona omu maisho gaawe, ahakuba niiwe waakigamba, MUKAMA Ruhanga; kandi omugisha gwawe gugume guheebwe enju y'omwiru waawe ebiro byona.<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okusingura kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1-18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 18:1-17">1 Bus 18:1-17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 60">Zab 60</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo Daudi yaasingura Abafilistia, yaabamara eishaija, yaiha Mesegama omu mikono yaabo. <verse eid="2SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:6">2 Sam 8:6</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 8:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaasingura Abamoabu, yaabarambika ahansi, yaabagyeresa omuguha; emishorongo ebiri yaaba ey'okwitwa, n'omushorongo gumwe gwaba ogw'okukira. Okuruga aho Abamoabu baahinduka abahuuku ba Daudi, baaguma nibamutoijera.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 14:47">1 Sam 14:47</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 10:6">2 Sam 10:6</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 10:16">16</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 10:19">19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Daudi yaasingura Hadadezeeri mwene Rehobu omugabe wa Zooba, naaza kugarura ensi eyaabaire eri omu bugabe bwe aha mugyera Furaati. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Daudi yaamunyagaho engabo z'abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi rukumi na magana mushanju, n'abarikugyendesa ebigyere obukumi bubiri; bwanyima Daudi yaatema ebiteega by'embaraasi ezirikukurura ebigaari zoona; kwonka yaatsigaho ezirikubaasa kukurura ebigaari igana. <verse eid="2SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:23-25">1 Bag 11:23-25</ref>. </char></note> Abasiria ba Damasiko ku baizire kuha Hadadezeeri omugabe wa Zooba emikono, Daudi yaabaitamu abantu obukumi bubiri n'enkumi ibiri. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Bwanyima Daudi yaata emitwe y'abarinzi omuri Siria eya Damasiko; n'Abasiria baahinduka abahuuku ba Daudi, baaguma nibamutoijera Kandi MUKAMA yaaguma naaha Daudi obusinguzi ahu yaabaire aza hoona. <verse eid="2SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:10">2 Bag 11:10</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaanyaga engabo z'ezaabu ezi abagaragwa ba Hadadezeeri baabaire baine, yaazitwara Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Kandi omugabe Daudi yaiha emiringa mingi munonga omuri Beeta na Berosai, endembo za Hadadezeeri.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Toi omugabe wa Hamasi ku yaahuriire ngu Daudi asingwire eihe ryona erya Hadadezeeri, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />yaatuma Yoramu omutabani aha mugabe Daudi kumuramutsya n'okumutabaarutsya ahabw'okurwana na Hadadezeeri n'okumusingura; ahabw'okuba Hadadezeeri akaba atuura naarwana na Toi. Yoramu ogwo yaijana ebintu by'efeeza, eby'ezaabu n'eby'emiringa. <verse eid="2SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:51">1 Bag 7:51</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 26:26">1 Bus 26:26</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo nabyo omugabe Daudi yaabishoroorera MUKAMA hamwe n'efeeza n'ezaabu ebi yaabaire ashoroire, abiihire omu mahanga goona agu yaabaire asingwire, <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:30">2 Sam 12:30</ref>. </char></note> ebya Siria, ebya Moabu, eby'Abaamoni, eby'Abafilistia, ebya Amaleki, n'eby'eminyago ya Hadadezeeri mwene Rehobu omugabe wa Zooba. <verse eid="2SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Daudi yaayetungira atyo eiziina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 8:13">Ku yaabaire naagaruka, yaitira omu ruhita rw'omwonyo Abanyaedomu kakumi n'enkumi munaana. <verse eid="2SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Kut 25:23</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 25:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 27:29">27:29</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 27:37">37</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 27:40">40</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 24:18">Kub 24:18</ref>. </char></note> Yaata emitwe y'abarinzi omuri Edomu; yaababuzya Edomu yoona; Abanyaedomu boona baahinduka abahuuku be. MUKAMA yaaguma naaha Daudi obusinguzi ahu yaabaire aza hoona.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Atyo Daudi yaategyeka Israeli yoona, kandi yaacwera abantu be boona emanja z'oburyo omu bwinganisa. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:23-26">2 Sam 20:23-26</ref>. </char></note> Obwo Yoabu mwene Zeruiya akaba ari omukuru w'eihe, Yehoshafaati mwene Ahiluudi ari omuhandiiki w'ebirikubaho; <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:3">1 Bag 4:3</ref>. </char></note> Zadoki mwene Ahitubu na Ahimeleki mwene Abiasaari bari abanyamurwa; Seraaya ari omuhandiiki; <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:18">2 Sam 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 1:38">1 Bag 1:38</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 4:4">4:4</ref>. </char></note> Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada ari omukuru w'aba Keresi n'aba Pelesi; kandi batabani ba Daudi bari abategyeki bakuru.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okugarura Mefiboshesi omu bintu bya Saulo ishenkuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 18:3">1 Sam 18:3</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 20:14">20:14</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 20:15">15</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 20:42">42</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Daudi yaabuuza ati: Ebyo haine owaatsigaireho omu nju ya Saulo, nkamukorera eby'embabazi ahabwa Yonasaani? <verse eid="2SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:1-4">2 Sam 16:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 19:17">19:17</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 19:29">29</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro ebyo hakaba hariho omuheereza ow'omu nju ya Saulo orikwetwa Ziiba; baamwetera Daudi omugabe, yaamubuuza ati: Niiwe Ziiba? Onu ati: Niinye omwiru waawe. <verse eid="2SA 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 4:4">2 Sam 4:4</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaamubuuza ati: Omu nju ya Saulo haine okiriho nkamukorera eby'embabazi za Ruhanga? Ziiba yaamugarukamu ati: Hakiriho mutabani wa Yonasaani, oremaire ebigyere. <verse eid="2SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:27">2 Sam 17:27</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaamubuuza ati: Arahi? Ziiba yaamugarukamu ati: Ari Lodebaari omu nju ya Makiri mwene Amieli. <verse eid="2SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Omugabe Daudi nikwo kutuma, bakamwiha Lodebaari omu nju ya Makiri mwene Amieli. <verse eid="2SA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:4">2 Sam 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 19:24">19:24</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 19:25">25</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 19:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 21:7">21:7</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Mefiboshesi mwene Yonasaani, mwijukuru wa Saulo yaija owa Daudi, yaajuumara omu maisho ge, yaamutangirira. Daudi yaamugira ati: Mefiboshesi! Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Omwiru waawe ari aha. <verse eid="2SA 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:28">2 Sam 19:28</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaamugira ati: Otatiina, ahabw'okuba buzimazima niinyija kukukorera eby'embabazi ahabwa Yonasaani sho, nkugarurire ebibanja bya shwenkuru byona; kandi oryaguma nooriira aha meeza yangye obutoosha. <verse eid="2SA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Mefiboshesi yaagaruka yaamwinamira, yaagira ati: omwiru waawe ni kintu ki, iwe okuunyetaho, nyowe embwa efiire?<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Bwanyima omugabe yaayeta Ziiba omuheereza wa Saulo, yaamugira ati: Ebyabaire biri ebya Saulo byona n'eby'ab'omu ka ye boona, naabiha mutabani wa mukama waawe. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:17">2 Sam 19:17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi iwe n'abatabani baawe n'abairu baawe mugume mumuhingire emisiri, mumureetere ebyezire, mutabani wa mukama waawe abone kutunga eby'okurya; kwonka Mefiboshesi mutabani wa mukama waawe aryaguma naariira aha meeza yangye obutoosha. Kandi Ziiba ogwo akaba aine abatabani ikumi na bataano, n'abairu makumi abiri. <verse eid="2SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Ziiba yaagira omugabe ati: Ebi Nyakusinga omugabe yaaragiira omwiru we byona, omwiru we nikwo araagume naabitwaza. Okuruga aho Mefiboshesi yaaguma naariira aha meeza y'omugabe, nk'omwana w'omugabe. <verse eid="2SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 8:34">1 Bus 8:34</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Mefiboshesi akaba aine omutabani muto orikwetwa Miika; ab'omu ka ya Ziiba boona bakaba bari abairu ba Mefiboshesi. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Atyo Mefiboshesi yaaguma Yerusaalemu, ahakuba akaba ariira aha meeza y'omugabe obutoosha; kandi akaba aremaire ebigyere byombi.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okusingura Abaamoni n'Abasiria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1-19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 19:1-19">1 Bus 19:1-19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo omugabe w'Abaamoni yaafa, omutabani Hanuni yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Daudi ku yaakihuriire, yaagira ati: Niinyija kukorera gye Hanuni mwene Nahashi, nk'oku ishe yankoreire gye. Atyo Daudi yaayohereza abagaragwa be kumuyaagira ahabw'okufeerwa ishe. Abagaragwa ba Daudi baahika omu nsi y'Abaamoni. <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />Kwonka abategyeki b'Abaamoni baagira Hanuni mukama waabo bati: Noogira ngu Daudi okukwoherereza ab'okukuyaagira n'okuha sho ekitiinisa? Torikumanya ku Daudi ayohereize abagaragwa be kwetegyereza orurembo n'okurutata, ngu arumareho? <verse eid="2SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 20:4">Isa 20:4</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo Hanuni yaakwata abagaragwa ba Daudi, yaabamwa ebireju by'orubaju rumwe, yaahirimburira rwagati ekicweka kya ifo eky'ebijwaro byabo okugarukira aha bibunu, yaaboohereza. <verse eid="2SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Ku baabigambiire Daudi, yaayohereza ab'okubabugana, ahabw'okuba bakaba baine enshoni nyingi munonga. Omugabe yaabatumaho ati: Mugume Yeriko okuhitsya obu obureju burikura, mukaija.<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:3">2 Sam 8:3</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 8:5">5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaamoni ku baamanyire ngu beetamiise Daudi, baatuma aha Basiria ba Besi-rehobu n'aba Zooba kubagurira ngu babahe engabo ezirikugyendesa ebigyere obukumi bubiri, n'omugabe wa Maaka kureeta engabo rukumi, n'aba Tobu kureeta kakumi n'enkumi ibiri. <verse eid="2SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:8">2 Sam 23:8</ref>. </char></note> Daudi ku yaakihuriire, yaayohereza Yoabu n'eihe ryona ery'amamanzi. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Abaamoni baashohora, baatenga orugamba aha irembo; kandi Abasiria ba Zooba n'aba Rehobu n'engabo za Tobu na Maaka bakaba bari ahakwabo omu ishwa. <verse eid="2SA 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Yoabu ku yaareebire engabo zimuri omu maisho n'enyima, yaatoorana abashaija entoore omu Baisraeli boona, yaabatengyesa orugamba kurwana n'Abasiria; <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />abandi boona yaabaha omurumuna Abishai, nawe yaabatengyesa orugamba kurwana n'Abaamoni. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Yaamugira ati: Abasiria ku barankize amaani, oije ompe emikono; kandi naiwe Abaamoni ku baraakukize amaani, naanye niinyija kugikuha. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Bir 31:6</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 16:13">1 Kor 16:13</ref>. </char></note> Guma omutima, turwane mashaija ahabw'eihanga ryaitu n'ahabw'endembo za Ruhanga waitu; kandi MUKAMA akore eki arikusiima. <verse eid="2SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Atyo Yoabu n'engabo ezi yaabaire aine, bairira haihi kurwanisa Abasiria; Abasiria baabahunga. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Abaamoni ku baareebire Abasiria baahunga, nabo baahunga Abishai, baataaha omu rurembo rwabo. Bwanyima Yoabu yaareka Abaamoni, yaagaruka Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2SA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Kwonka Abasiria ku baareebire babingirwe Abaisraeli baayeteerana. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:3">2 Sam 8:3</ref>. </char></note> Hadadezeeri yaatuma aha Basiria abaabaire batwire seeri y'omugyera Furaati baarugayo, baaza Helamu, beebembeirwe Shobaki omukuru w'eihe rya Hadadezeeri. <verse eid="2SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Ku baagambiire Daudi, nawe yaateerana Israeli yoona, baayambuka Yorudani, baaza Helamu, Abasiria baatenga orugamba, baarwana na Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Abasiria baahunga Abaisraeli, Daudi yaita omu Basiria abantu abarikurwanira aha bigaari magana mushanju, n'ab'aha mbaraasi obukumi buna, kandi baacumita Shobaki omukuru w'eihe ryabo, baamugwisaho. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:6">2 Sam 8:6</ref>. </char></note> Abo bagabe boona abaabaire nibaheereza Hadadezeeri, ku baareebire baasingurwa Abaisraeli, baabeehongyera, baabatabaarira. N'ahabw'ekyo Abasiria baatiina kugaruka kuha Abaamoni emikono.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ekibi kya Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 12:26">2 Sam 12:26</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 20:1">1 Bus 20:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kutandika kw'omwaka, omu bunaku obu abagabe baabaire bahururiramu, Daudi akoohereza Yoabu kuhurura n'abagaragwa be n'Abaisraeli, baacwekyereza Abaamoni, bwanyima baagota Rabba. Kwonka Daudi we akaba ayetsigariire Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Eizooba rimwe omu mwabazyo, Daudi yaimuka aha kitanda kye, yaagyendagyenda aha mutwe gwa nyaruju y'omugabe. Ku yaabaire ayemereireho, yaareeba omukazi naayoga; kandi omukazi ogwo akaba ari murungi munonga w'okurigira. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:34">2 Sam 23:34</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 23:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 3:5">1 Bus 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaatuma kumubuuririza. Omuntu omwe yaagira ati: Beitu ogwo ti Batisheba muhara wa Eliamu, muka Uriya Omuhiiti? <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 15:19">Lev 15:19</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 15:28">28</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaatuma entumwa, zaamureeta, yaija owe, Daudi yaabyama nawe; ahakuba akaba azirukire; bwanyima yaagaruka omuka. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Ku haahingwireho ebiro bikye, yaagira enda, yaatuma ahari Daudi ati: Nyine enda.<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />N'ahabw'ekyo Daudi yaatuma ahari Yoabu ati: nyoherereza Uriya Omuhiiti. Atyo Yoabu yaamumwoherereza. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Uriya ku yaahikire Daudi, Daudi yaamubuuza oku Yoabu ari n'engabo ze, n'ahu obweme bwahika. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Bwanyima Daudi yaamugira ati: Irooko oshuume owaawe, onaabe aha bigyere. Atyo Uriya yaaruga omuri nyaruju y'omugabe, omugabe yaamukuratsa eky'okumufungurira. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Kwonka Uriya yaabyama aha irembo rya nyaruju hamwe n'abaheereza ba mukama we, tiyaataaha mu ka ye. <verse eid="2SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Ku baagambiire Daudi ku Uriya atataahire muka, Daudi yaabuuza Uriya ati: Beitu shi torikuruga omu rugyendo? N'enki ekikuzibiire kutaaha omuka? <verse eid="2SA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:2">2 Sam 7:2</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Uriya yaagarukamu Daudi ati: Eshanduukye ya Ruhanga n'Abaisraeli n'Abayuda nibaraara omu nsiisira; kandi mukama wangye Yoabu n'abagaragwa ba mukama wangye basiisiire omu ishwa. Mbwenu nyowe nze omuka kurya, kunywa n'okuraara n'omukazi wangye? Buso bwawe, ninkurahira tindikwija kukikora. <verse eid="2SA 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Daudi yaagira Uriya ati: Siiba aha n'eri izooba, nyencakare nkuragye ogyende. Atyo Uriya yaasiiba Yerusaalemu eryo izooba n'eryakuratsireho. <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Daudi yaamweta, yaarya, yaanywera omu maisho ge, yaamusinza. Nyekiro Uriya yaashohora, yaaza kubyama aha kitanda kye hamwe n'abagaragwa ba mukama we, tiyaagira bu agiire omuka.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Ku bwaseesire, Daudi yaahandiikira Yoabu ebaruha, yaagitweka Uriya. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:9">2 Sam 12:9</ref>. </char></note> Omuri egyo baruha yaahandiikamu ati: Mute Uriya omu kaso k'orugamba, ahu ruhamire, mumutsigyeho, bamucumite, afe. <verse eid="2SA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Bwanyima Yoabu ku yaabaire agotsire orurembo, yaata Uriya ahu arikumanya ku niho amamanzi gari. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Abanyarurembo baashohora, baarwana na Yoabu, abamwe aha bagaragwa ba Daudi baafa, na Uriya Omuhiiti nawe yaafa. <verse eid="2SA 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Yoabu yaayohereza entumwa kugambira Daudi amakuru goona ag'orugamba, <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />yaayehanangiriza entumwa, naagira ati: ku oraaheze kugambira omugabe amakuru g'orugamba, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />yaaguubwa kubi, yaakugira ati: Ahabw'enki murwaine mukahika haihi n'orurembo? Mubaire mutarikumanya ku barikubaasa kubarasha, beemereire aha rugo rw'amabaare? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:53">Bar 9:53</ref>. </char></note> Nimugira ngu owaitsire Abimeleki mwene Yerubeshesi n'oha? T'omukazi owaamuteereire eseiso Tebeza ayemereire aha rugo, akamugwisaho? Ahabw'enki muhikire haihi n'orugo mutyo? Naiwe omugarukyemu oti: Manya omushaija waawe Uriya Omuhiiti nawe afiire.<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Etyo entumwa yaagyenda, yaagambira Daudi ebi Yoabu agitumire byona. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Entumwa yaagira Daudi eti: Abantu baayo batubingire, baatuhitsya omu ishwa ahi tubaire turi, kwonka naitwe twababainga, twarugaho twabahitsya omu irembo. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Bwanyima abarasi abaabaire beemereire aha rugo baarasha abairu baawe; mbwenu bamwe aha bagaragwa b'omugabe bafiire, Omuhiiti yaabafamu. <verse eid="2SA 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Daudi yaagira egyo ntumwa ati: oku nikwo oraagire Yoabu oti: Ekyo kirekye kukugwisa kubi; ahakubi rurara eita omuntu, obundi eita ondiijo. Yeyongyere kuhamya orugamba; orwane n'orurembo, orusingure. Kandi naiwe, ku oraahikyeyo, omugumye.<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Muka Uriya ku yaahuriire ngu iba afiire, yaamucurira. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:9">2 Sam 12:9</ref>. </char></note> Ku baarugire omu rufu, Daudi yaamutuma, yaamutaasya omwe, yaaba omukazi we, yaamuzaarira omwana w'omwojo. Kwonka eki Daudi yaakozire kyagwisa kubi MUKAMA.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Nasani okuhana Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 7:2">2 Sam 7:2</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:4">4</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 1:10">1 Bag 1:10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 1:22">22</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 1:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 4:5">4:5</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:29">1 Bus 29:29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:29">2 Bus 9:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaatuma Nasani ahari Daudi. Yaija ah'ari, yaamugira ati: Hakaba hariho abashaija babiri omu rurembo, omwe ari omutungi, n'ondi ari omworo. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Ogwo mutungi akaba aine amasyo maingi g'entaama n'ag'ente, <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />kwonka ogwo mworo akaba ataine kindi eki atungire, kureka akaagazi k'entaama kamwe, aku yaabaire aguzire. Yaakoorora, kaakurira owe n'abaana be; kaaguma nikarya aha tw'okurya twe, nikanywera aha kikopo kye, kandi nikabyama omu kifuba kye; kaaba nka muhara we. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Eizooba rimwe ogwo mutungi yaaraarirwa omugyenyi; kwonka tiyaayenda kubaagira ogwo muhinguzi owaamuraarira omu masyo ge g'entaama nari ag'ente, kureka yaatwara ako kataama k'ori mworo, yaaba niko yaamubaagira. <verse eid="2SA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Daudi ku yaakihuriire, yaagirira ogwo mushaija ekiniga kingi munonga, yaagira Nasani ati: Nindahira MUKAMA otahwaho, omushaija okozire ekyo kintu akaabaire ow'okufa; <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:1">Kur 22:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:8">Luk 19:8</ref>. </char></note> mbwenu arihe ako kataama kana ahabw'okukora ekyo n'ahabw'okutagira saasi.<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 16:13">1 Sam 16:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nasani yaagira Daudi ati: Manya ogwo mushaija niiwe. MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli naakugira ati: Nkakushukaho amajuta kuba omugabe wa Israeli, naakwiha omu mikono ya Saulo; <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />naakuha enju ya mukama waawe, n'abakazi be kukushegura; kandi naakuha enju ya Israeli n'eya Yuda. Eki ku kyakubaire kiri kikye, nkaakwongyeire ebindi bingi. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:31">Kub 15:31</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:19">1 Sam 15:19</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 11:15">2 Sam 11:15</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 11:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'enki ogayire ekigambo kya MUKAMA, okakora ekirikwangwa omu maisho ge? Oitsire Uriya Omuhiiti na rurara, waatwara omukazi we, waamushwera; waamwitsa rurara y'Abaamoni. <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />N'ahabw'ekyo rurara teriruga mu ka yaawe, ahabw'okungaya, okatwara muka Uriya Omuhiiti kuba omukazi waawe. <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />Kandi MUKAMA naakugira ati: Ndyaimutsya ebihikiirizi omu ka yaawe, nkwakye abakazi baawe nooreeba, mbahe mutaahi waawe, abyame nabo nyomushana. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:22">2 Sam 16:22</ref>. </char></note> Okakikora bwesherekye, kwonka ekyangye ndyakikora nyomushana omu maisho ga Israeli yoona. <verse eid="2SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:10">2 Sam 24:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 32:1">Zab 32:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 32:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:4">51:4</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:18">Mik 7:18</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagira Nasani ati: Ncumwire ahari MUKAMA. Naasani yaagira Daudi ati: MUKAMA nawe yaihaho ekibi kyawe; tokifa. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Isa 52:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:20">Ezk 36:20</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 36:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:24">Rom 2:24</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ahabw'ekyo eki okozire, okareetera abazigu ba MUKAMA kumujuma, omwana ogwo ozairwe buzimazima naija kufa.<verse eid="2SA 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okweteisa kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Bwanyima Nasani yaagarukayo owe. MUKAMA yaarwaza ogwo mwana, ou muka Uriya yaazaariire Daudi, yaaremba munonga. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:31">2 Sam 13:31</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:27">1 Bag 21:27</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo Daudi yaayeshengyereza MUKAMA ahabwe; Daudi yaayesiibyakwo, yaataaha omu nju, yaabyama ahansi, bwarugaho bwasheesha. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Abakuru b'enju ye baamwemerera aha rubaju kumwimutsya ahansi, yaabangira, kandi tiyaarya nabo. <verse eid="2SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Aha kiro kya mushanju, ogwo mwana yaakaba. Abagaragwa ba Daudi baatiina kumugambira ku omwana yaakaba; ahakuba bakagira bati: Reeba, ku turaabe tumugambiire, omwana akihuriire, akanga kutuhurira, nitwija kumugambira tuta omwana yaakabire? Tarikwija kwekora kubi? <verse eid="2SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Kwonka Daudi, ku yaareebire abagaragwa nibagambirana omu kutu, yaamanyira aho ku omwana yaakaba. Daudi yaababuuza ati: Omwana yaakaba? Baamugarukamu bati: Yaakaba. <verse eid="2SA 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:20">Yob 1:20</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaimuka ahansi, yaayoga, yaayesiiga, yaahindura ebijwaro bye, yaataaha omu nju ya MUKAMA, yaaramya. Ku yaaherize, yaataaha omwe, yaashaba eby'okurya, baabimuta omu maisho, yaarya. <verse eid="2SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Abagaragwa be baamubuuza bati: Eki waakora ki? Oyesiibizekwo, waaririra omwana akihuriire; mbwenu omwana ku yaaheza kufa, waimuka waarya! <verse eid="2SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:9">Yon 3:9</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagira ati: Omwana obu abaire akihuriire, nyesiibizekwo, naarira; ahakuba ngizire nti: N'oha orikumanya ngu MUKAMA tarikwija kungirira embabazi, omwana akagumaho? <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:8-10">Yob 7:8-10</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ka yaafiire, niinyesiibizakwo ki? Nimbaasa kumuhimbuura? Ndyamukurata, kwonka we taringarukira.<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 22:9">1 Bus 22:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:6">Mat 1:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Daudi yaagumya omukazi we Betisheba, yaamuraarira; ebiro ku byahingwireho, yaamuzaarira omwana w'omwojo, yaamweta Sulemaani. Omwana ogwo MUKAMA yaamukunda; <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />yaatuma nabi Nasani, yaamweta Yedidiya ahabwa MUKAMA.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 3:11">Bir 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 11:1">2 Sam 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 20:1-3">1 Bus 20:1-3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuri ebyo biro Yoabu yaarwanisa Rabba ey'Abaamoni, yaakwata orurembo rw'obugabe. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Yoabu yaatuma entumwa ahari Daudi, naagira ati: Ndwaniise Rabba, kandi naakwata orurembo rw'amaizi. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />N'ahabw'ekyo oteerane engabo ezitsigaireho, ziteere ensiisira ahari orwo rurembo, obe niiwe waarukwata, ntakaarukwata, rukaanyetererwa. <verse eid="2SA 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Atyo Daudi yaateerana engabo zoona, yaaza Rabba, yaagirwanisa, yaagikwata. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Yaiha ekirunga aha mutwe gwa Milikomu, ekishushani kyabo ekirikuramibwa, oburemeezi bwakyo etalanta emwe y'ezaabu, ekyabaire kirimu eibaare ry'obuguzi bwingi; baakita aha mutwe gwa Daudi. Kandi omuri orwo rurembo yaanyagamu eminyago mingi munonga. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Yaihamu abantu abaabaire barimu, yaabashara n'emisimeeno n'ebyoma by'amaino, n'empango z'ebyoma, yaabarabya omu tanuuru z'amatafaari; okwo nikwo yaagizire endembo zoona ez'Abaamoni. Bwanyima Daudi n'engabo zoona baagaruka Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Abusalomu okwita Amunooni ahabw'okuhamba munyaanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 3:2">2 Sam 3:2</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 3:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 3:2">1 Bus 3:2</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 3:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Abusalomu mwene Daudi akaba aine munyaanya murungi orikwetwa Tamari. Ebiro ku byahingwireho, Amunooni mwene Daudi yaamurigira. <verse eid="2SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Amunooni ahabw'okurigira okwo okubi oku yaarigiire Tamari munyaanya, yaarwara; ahabw'okuba munyaanya ogwo akaba ari omwishiki otakamanyire mushaija; kandi yaareeba kigumire kugira eki yaamukoraho. <verse eid="2SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:9">1 Sam 16:9</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 17:13">17:13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 2:13">1 Bus 2:13</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Amunooni akaba aine munywani we orikwetwa Yonadabu, mwene Shimea mukuru wa Daudi; kandi Yonadabu ogwo akaba ari enyabwengye. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Yaamubuuza ati: Iwe mutabani w'omugabe 'we, ahabw'enki noogyenda noohwa aha magufa? Tokaakingambira? Amunooni yaamugarukamu ati: Ndigiire Tamari, munyaanya wa Abusalomu, mwene tata. <verse eid="2SA 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Yonadabu yaamugira ati: Irooko obyame aha kitanda kyawe, oyerwaze; bwanyima aho ku araije kukureeba, omugire oti: Ninkweshengyereza, ikiriza munyaanyazi Tamari aije, andeetere eby'okuraya, abiteekyere omu maisho gangye nimbireeba, mbiriire omu ngaro ze. <verse eid="2SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Atyo Amunooni yaabyama, yaayerwaza; bwanyima omugabe ku yaizire kumureeba, Amunooni yaamugira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, ntwekyera munyaanyazi Tamari, aije, anteekyere omu maisho otukeeki tubiri, nturiire omu ngaro ze.<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Daudi nikwo kutuma omuka ahari Tamari, akamugira ati: Irooko oze owa munyaanyoko Amunooni, omuteekyere eby'okurya. <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Atyo Tamarai yaaza owa munyaanya, yaashanga abyami. Yaagira eisyanga, yaaribumbabumba, yaarikoreramu otukeeki omu maisho ge, yaatuteeka. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Yaakwata eky'okukarangaho, yaatumwihurira omu maisho, kwonka yaayanga kurya. Amunooni yaagira ati: Abashaija boona bampigize. Abashaija boona bamuhigiza, baashohora. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Amunooni yaagira Tamari ati: Reeta eby'okurya omu kishengye, mbiriire omu ngaro zaawe. Tamari nikwo kugira otwo tukeeki, otu yaateeka, akatutwarira munyaanya Amunooni omu kishengye. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Ku yaatumuhikize ngu arye, yaamukwata, yaamugira ati: Ija obyame naanye, munyaanyazi. <verse eid="2SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:9">Lev 18:9</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 18:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:17">20:17</ref>. </char></note> Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Ngaaha, munyaanyazi, otampamba; ahakuba ekintu nk'ekyo tikikorwa muri Israeli; otakora eky'obufamutima nk'ekyo. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Mbwenu nkaanye, ekyo kihagaro nkaatoora hi nakyo? Kandi naiwe okaahinduka ekifa-mutima omuri Israeli. Mbwenu ninkweshengyereza, okigambire omugabe; ahakuba tarikwija kukuunyima. <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Kwonka yaayanga kumuhurira; kandi ahabw'okumukiza amaani, yaamuhamba, yaabyama nawe. <verse eid="2SA 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Okuruga aho Amunooni yaamwanga okutakareebwaga; kandi okwanga oku yaamwangire kukakira okukunda oku yaabaire naamukunda. Amunooni yaamugira ati: Imuka ogyende. <verse eid="2SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Kwonka onu yaamugarukamu ati: Ngaaha, munyaanyazi; ahakuba ekibi eki eki orikukora kumbinga ni kihango okukira ekyo eki wankora. Amunooni yaayanga kumuhurira. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Yaayeta omutsigazi owaabaire naamuheereza, yaamugira ati: Nyiha ogu mwishiki omu maisho; ku araashohore, omukuratse orwigi, orukome. <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 45:14">Zab 45:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Tamari akaba ajwaire ekijwaro ky'emikono miraingwa, ahakuba bahara b'omugabe abatakashweirwe nikwo baabaire bajwara. Atyo omuheereza wa Amunooni yaamushohoza, yaakoma orwigi. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:6">Yos 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 1:11">2 Sam 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:37">Yer 2:37</ref>. </char></note> Tamari yaayeshukyera eiju omu mutwe, yaataagura ekyo kijwaro ky'emikono miraingwa eki yaabaire ajwaire, yaayekorera emikono, yaagyenda naaborooga. <verse eid="2SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Bwanyima munyaanya Abusalomu yaamubuuza ati: Munyaanyoko Amunooni yaaba ari hamwe naiwe? Mbwenu hunama, munyaanyazi; manya nawe ni munyaanyoko; ekyo orekye kukitaho omutima. Atyo Tamari yaaguma owa munyaanya Abusalomu, ari enshoberwa. <verse eid="2SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Omugabe Daudi ku yaahuriire ebyo byona, yaagira ekiniga kingi; <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />kwonka Abusalomu tiyaagira ki yaagambira Amunooni, yaaba kibi nari kirungi; ahabw'okuba akamwanga ahabw'okuhamba Tamari munyaanya.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 25:4">1 Sam 25:4</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 25:36">36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku haahingwireho emyaka ebiri eijwire, Abusalomu yaatwara abakyemuzi b'okumukyemurira ebyoya by'entaama ze Baali-hazori haihi na Efuraimu; Abusalomu yaayeta batabani b'omugabe boona. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Yaija aha mugabe, yaamugira ati: Reeba, omwiru waawe aine abakyemuzi b'entaama; ninshaba omugabe n'abairu be, bagyende n'omwiru waawe. <verse eid="2SA 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Kwonka omugabe yaagira Abusalomu ati: Ngaaha, mwana wangye, ka turekye kugyenda twena, tutakaakurusya. Abusalomu yaamugyemesereza kwonka onu yaayanga, yaamushabira omugisha. <verse eid="2SA 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Bwanyima Abusalomu yaamugira ati: Ku oraabe otarikwija, reka tugyende na Amunooni mukuru wangye. Omugabe yaamugira ati: Ahabw'enki ashemereire kugyenda naiwe? <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Abusalomu yaamugyemesereza, okuhitsya obu yaikiriize Amunooni n'abatabani b'omugabe boona kugyenda nawe. <verse eid="2SA 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Bwanyima Abusalomu yaaragiira abaheereza be ati: Mugume mutaire eriisho ahari Amunooni; ku murareebe yaasinda viinyo, nkabagira nti: Muteere Amunooni, mumwite mutatiina. Tiinye naabaragiira? Mugume omutima, mube emanzi. <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Batyo abaheereza ba Abusalomu baagira Amunooni, nk'oku Abusalomu yaabaragiira. Ahonaaho batabani b'omugabe boona baimuka, buri omwe yaayenaga aha nyumbu ye, baahunga.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Ku baabaire bakiri omu muhanda, enkuru yaahika Daudi ngu Abusalomu aitsire batabani b'omugabe boona, tihaatsigaraho na wa kizira. <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:11">2 Sam 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 12:16">12:16</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaimuka, yaataagura ebijwaro bye, yaabyama ahansi; n'abagaragwa be boona abaabaire beemereireho nabo baataagura ebijwaro byabo. <verse eid="2SA 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:3">2 Sam 13:3</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Yonadabu, mwene Shimea mukuru w'omugabe, yaagira ati: Mukama wangye atagira ngu baitsire abatsigazi boona, batabani b'omugabe; kureka ofiire ni Amunooni wenka, ahabw'okuba okwiha obu yaahamba munyaanya Tamari, Abusalomu akamariirira kukora ekyo, kandi niwe akiragiire. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />N'ahabw'ekyo mukama wangye omugabe arekye kukitaho omutima, akagira ngu batabani b'omugabe boona bafiire; kureka Amunooni wenka niwe afiire.<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Okuruga aho Abusalomu yaahunga. Bwanyima omutsigazi owaabaire naarinda, ku yaanagire amaisho, yaareeba abantu baingi nibareetwa omuhanda ogurikuruga Horonaimu aha rubaju rw'ekibungo. <verse eid="2SA 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Yonadabu yaagira omugabe ati: Reeba, batabani b'omugabe baija, nk'oku omwiru waawe yaagira, nikwo byaba. <verse eid="2SA 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Ku yaabaire yaaheza ati kugamba, reeba batabani b'omugabe baija, baimutsya amaraka gaabo, baaborooga; omugabe nawe n'abagaragwa be boona baarira munonga.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 3:3">2 Sam 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 14:23">14:23</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 14:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:8">15:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Abusalomu yaahunga, yaaza owa Talumai mwene Amihuudi, omugabe wa Geshuri. Kandi Daudi yaaguma naacurira omutabani buri izooba. <verse eid="2SA 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Atyo Abusalomu yaahunga, yaaza Geshuri, yaamarayo emyaka eshatu. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Bwanyima Daudi yaayetenga munonga kuza kureeba Abusalomu, ahakuba obusaasi bwa Amunooni bukaba bwamurugireho, ahabw'okureeba ku yaafiire.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Enaama ya Yoabu okushaba Daudi kugarura Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 13:39">2 Sam 13:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo Yoabu mwene Zeruiya akamanya ku omutima gwa Daudi guri ahari Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Yoabu yaatuma Tekoa, yaihayo omukazi w'obwengye, yaamugira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, oyehindure nk'ofeereirwe, ojware ebijwaro by'ofeereirwe, orekye kwesiiga amajuta, kureka otwaze nk'omukazi omazire ebiro bingi ari omu rufu; <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:19">2 Sam 14:19</ref>. </char></note> otaahe ow'omugabe omugambire ebigambo ebi. Atyo Yoabu yaamugambira ebi araagambe.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 6:26">2 Bag 6:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogwo mukazi wa Tekoa ku yaahikire aha mugabe, yaagwa ahansi, yaajuumara omu maisho ge, yaamutangirira, yaamugira ati: Mpa emikono, Nyakusinga! <verse eid="2SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Omugabe yaamubuuza ati: obaire ota? Yaamugarukamu ati: Buzimazima ndi omufaakazi, omushaija wangye akafa. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Omuzaana waawe akaba aine abaana b'aboojo babiri. Ku baabaire bari omu ishwa, baatongana, baabura kiramura, omwe yaateera ondi, yaamwita. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Mbwenu reeba, abanyaruganda boona bayookyeire omuzaana waawe, baamugira bati, Tuheereze oitsire mukuru we, tumwite, tumuture ou aitsire. Mbwenu nibenda kwita n'omuhunguzi. Okwo nikwo barikwenda kuzimya eikara eri ntsigaire naryo, ngu batatsigira omushaija wangye eiziina omu nsi n'obu kwakuba okugira ou baatsigaho. <verse eid="2SA 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Omugabe yaagira ogwo mukazi ati: Garuka owaawe, naaza kugira eki naakora aha byawe. <verse eid="2SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:24">1 Sam 25:24</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo mukazi wa Tekoa yaagira omugabe ati: Mukama wangye, Nyakusinga omugabe, mbe niinye naagira orubanja, n'enju ya tata; kwonka omugabe n'engoma ye bitarugira. <verse eid="2SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Omugabe yaagira ati: Omuntu weena oraakugambeho, omundeetere, tarikugarukaho bundi. <verse eid="2SA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:19">Kub 35:19</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 35:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:12">Bir 19:12</ref>. </char></note> Omukazi yaagira ati: Mbwenu Nyakusinga omugabe, ninkweshengyereza, rahira MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, ku hatakiija kubaho muhoozi w'enzigu obundi, bakacwekyereza mutabani wangye. Onu ati: Nindahira MUKAMA otahwaho, n'obu kaakuba akashokye kamwe k'omwana waawe tikarigwa hansi.<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Omukazi yaamugarukamu ati: Nyakusinga, omuzaana waawe k'agambire omugabe ekigambo kimwe. Onu ati: Gamba. <verse eid="2SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:37">2 Sam 13:37</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 13:38">38</ref>. </char></note> Omukazi yaabuuza ati: Ahabw'enki ocumiire abantu ba Ruhanga enaama erikushusha ebyo? Ahabw'okuba omu kutaho ekiragiro ekyo omugabe naaba naakyeteeraho, ahakuba takagaruraga muntu we owaabingirwe. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:15">Kub 35:15</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 35:25">25</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 35:28">28</ref>. </char></note> Twena turi ab'okufa, nitushusha nk'amaizi agaatikire ahansi, agatakibaasa kuyoorwa bundi; kandi na Ruhanga ahabwe taihiraho kimwe magara b'omuntu, kureka ataho oburyo, ngu ou yaabingire arekye kubeera kimwe encuubwa. <verse eid="2SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Mbwenu naija kugambira mukama wangye omugabe ekigambo eki, ahabw'okuba abantu bantiiniise. Omuzaana waawe yaateekateeka, naagira ati: Mbwenu niinyija kugamba n'omugabe; obundi omugabe akaakorera omuzaana we eki yaamushaba; <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 26:19">1 Sam 26:19</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba omugabe naija kubihurira, akize omuzaana we ogwo muntu orikwenda kumucwekyereza n'omwana we, n'okubaiha omu buhunguzi bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 29:9">1 Sam 29:9</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 19:27">2 Sam 19:27</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuzaana waawe ateekateekire ngu, Ekigambo kya mukama wangye omugabe nikiija kumpuumuza; ahakuba mukama wangye omugabe ni nka maraika wa Ruhanga omu kukyenga ebibi n'ebirungi. MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe agume naiwe!<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Bwanyima omugabe yaagarukamu ogwo mukazi ati: otanshereka ekigambo kyona eki ndaakubuuze. Omukazi yaamugira ati: Mukama wangye omugabe akigambe. <verse eid="2SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:3">2 Sam 14:3</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaamubuuza ati: Beitu okwataniise na Yoabu omuri ebyo byona? Omukazi yaamugarukamu ati: Ninkurahira, mukama wangye omugabe, tihariho waakubaasa kutoora aha rubaju rwa buryo nari orwa bumosho, okwetantara ekigambo kyona eki mukama wangye omugabe yaagamba. N'ekya buzima omwiru waawe Yoabu niwe aragiire omuzaana waawe, kandi niwe ampaire ebigambo ebyo byona kubigamba. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Ahabw'okwenda ku bihinduka okundi, omwiru waawe Yoabu nikyo abitwariize atyo. Kandi mukama wangye n'omunyabwengye nka maraika wa Ruhanga, naamanya ebiri omu nsi byona. <verse eid="2SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Bwanyima omugabe yaagira Yoabu ati: Reeba mbwenu naikiriza; irooko, ogarure ogwo mutsigazi Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Yoabu yaagwa ahansi, yaajuumara omu maisho g'omugabe, yaamusiima; naagira ati: Eri izooba omwiru waawe yaamanya ku yaagirirwa embabazi omu maisho gaawe, Nyakusinga omugabe, ahabw'okuba omugabe yaakorera omwiru we eki amushabire. <verse eid="2SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:38">2 Sam 13:38</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Yoabu yaimuka, yaaza Geshuri, yaareeta Abusalomu Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Bwanyima omugabe yaagira ati: Naagarukye omu ka ye, kwonka atarindeeba. Atyo Abusalomu yaaguma wenka omu ka ye, tiyaagira bu areebire omugabe.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Kandi omu Baisraeli boona tihariho waabaire naasiimwa nka Abusalomu ahabw'oburungi bwe; okuruga aha mara g'ekigyere okuhika aha kazingiro k'eishokye akaba ataine kamogo. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Aha muheru gwa buri mwaka akaba amweisa eishokye rye; ahabw'okumuremeera, nikyo yaabaire arimweisiza, kandi ku yaabaire arimweisa, oburemeezi bwaryo bukaba buba <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">shekeli ezo magana abiri nizingana eraatiri ishatu n'ekicweka. </char></note>shekeli magana abiri, nka shekeli y'omugabe oku yaabaire eingana. <verse eid="2SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:18">2 Sam 18:18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Abusalomu akazaarirwa abaana b'aboojo bashatu, n'omwishiki owaabaire naayetwa Tamari; akaba ari omwishiki murungi omu kureeba.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Atyo Abusalomu yaamara emyaka ebiri Yerusaalemu, atarikureebana na mugabe. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Bwanyima Abusalomu yaatuma kweta Yoabu, ngu amutume aha mugabe; kwonka Yoabu yaayanga kwija. Yaagaruka yaamutumaho obwa kabiri; nabwo yaayanga kwija. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Nikwo kugambira abairu be ati: Reeba, omusiri gwa Yoabu guhereraine n'ogwangye; hati gurimu sayiri; mugyende mugwotsye. Batyo abairu ba Abusalomu baagyenda, baagwotsya. <verse eid="2SA 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Yoabu yaimuka, yaaza owa Abusalomu, yaamubuuza ati: Ahabw'enki abairu baawe baanyokyeize omusiri? <verse eid="2SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 20:8">1 Sam 20:8</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 13:38">2 Sam 13:38</ref>. </char></note> Abusalomu yaagarukamu Yoabu ati: Reeba nkutumireho ngu oije aha, nkutume aha mugabe, omumbuurize oti: Nkaihwa ki Geshuri? Haakiri kuri naagumireyo n'okuhitsya hati. Mbwenu omugabe anyikirize ndeebane nawe; ku harabe hariho okutahikiirira omuriinye, anyite. <verse eid="2SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:12">Kut 29:12</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 31:55">31:55</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 15:20">Luk 15:20</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Yoabu yaaza ow'omugabe, yaabimugambira. Bwanyima omugabe yaatuma ahari Abusalomu, yaija; ku yaahikire omugabe, yainama ahansi omu maisho ge; omugabe yaamunywegyera.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Abusalomu okugomesa abantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 1:5">1 Bag 1:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo Abusalomu yaayegirira ekigaari n'embaraasi n'abashaija makumi ataano b'okumwebembera. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:1">Rus 4:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi akaba aimuka kare, ayemerera aha rubaju rw'eirembo; omuntu weena owaabaire aija aha mugabe aine eki arikutongana, Abusalomu amweta, amubuuza ati: Ori owa rurembo ki? Onu amugarukamu ati: Nyowe omwiru waawe ndi ow'omu ruganda nanka orw'omu nganda za Israeli. <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Abusalomu amugira ati: Reeba, orubanja rwawe ni rurungi kandi ruhikire; kwonka omugabe taine u atsigiire kuhurira ebyawe. <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Abusalomu agaruka amugira ati: Kuri noogira ngu niinye muramuzi w'omu nsi egi, buri muntu weena owaakubaire aine eki arikufa nari orubanja, akaanyizireho, ncwa orubanja rwe omu buryo obuhikire. <verse eid="2SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Kandi omuntu ku yaabaire aija kumutangirira, akaba amukununkirira, amukwata, amunywegyera. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Okwo nikwo Abusalomu yaabaire atwaza Abaisraeli boona abaabaire bareeta emanja zaabo aha mugabe; omu buryo obwo Abusalomu yaiba emitima y'Abaisraeli.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 16:1">1 Sam 16:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku haahingwireho emyaka ena, Abusalomu yaagira omugabe ati: Ninkweshengyereza, nyikiriza nze Heburooni, mpikiirize okuhiga oku naahigire nindaganisa MUKAMA. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:20">Kut 28:20</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 28:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:11">1 Sam 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 13:38">2 Sam 13:38</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nyowe, omwiru waawe, obu naabaire ndi Geshuri omuri Siria, nkahiga nindaganisa nti: MUKAMA ku aringarura Yerusaalemu, buzima ndyamuheereza. <verse eid="2SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1:17">1 Sam 1:17</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaamugira ati: Gyenda n'obusingye. Atyo yaimuka yaaza Heburooni. <verse eid="2SA 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Kwonka Abusalomu yaayohereza entatsi omu nganda za Israeli zoona, naagira ati: Ku muraahurire okugamba kw'enzamba, ahonaaho mugire muti: Abusalomu yaaba omugabe omuri Heburooni. <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 9:13">1 Sam 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:3">16:3</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 16:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuri okwo kugyenda kwa Abusalomu akagyenda n'abashaija magana abiri, abu yaayetsire kugyenda nawe okuruga Yerusaalemu, baafa okugyenda bataine ki barikumanya. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:31">2 Sam 15:31</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 16:20">16:20</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 17:1">17:1</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 17:14">14</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 27:33">1 Bus 27:33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 3:1">Zab 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 55:12-14">55:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 41:9">41:9</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Abusalomu ku yaabaire naatamba ebitambo bye, yaatuma kweta Ahisofeeli owa Giilo, omuhi w'obwengye wa Daudi kuruga omu rurembo rw'owaabo Giilo. Kutyo okwebumba okwo kwayeyongyera kuba okw'amaani, ahakuba abantu bakeeyongyera obutoosha kwebumba na Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi okuhunga Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Bwanyima haija entumwa ahari Daudi, yaagira eti: Emitima y'Abaisraeli ekumbiire ahari Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Daudi nikwo kugira abagaragwa be boona, abu yaabaire aine Yerusaalemu ati: Nimwimukye tuhungye; ku turaabe tutahungire, tihariho n'omwe omuriitwe oraakire Abusalomu. Murahukye kugyenda, atakaatuhika, akatukora kubi, akacwekyereza orurembo na rurara. <verse eid="2SA 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Abagaragwa b'omugabe baamugira bati: Reeba, abairu baawe beeteekateekire kukora kyona, eki mukama waitu omugabe arikusiima. <verse eid="2SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:21">2 Sam 16:21</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 16:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 20:3">20:3</ref>. </char></note> Atyo omugabe yaashohora n'ab'omu ka ye boona bamukuratiire; kwonka yaatsigamu abakazi ikumi b'ebinyanshunju kurinda eka. <verse eid="2SA 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Omugabe yaagyenda n'abantu boona bamukuratiire; ku baahikire Besi-merubaaki, baayemereraho. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Batyo abagaragwa be boona baamurabaho; n'aba Keresi boona, n'aba Pelesi boona, n'aba Gaasi boona, abashaija magana mukaaga abaarugire Gaasi omu maisho g'omugabe.<verse eid="2SA 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 18:2">2 Sam 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 1:16">Rus 1:16</ref>, <ref loc="RUT 1:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omugabe yaagira Itaayi owa Gaasi ati: Ahabw'enki naiwe noogyenda naitwe? Garukayo, ogume n'omugabe; ahabw'okuba ori omunyaihanga, owaarugire owaabo abingirwe. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Iwe oizire nyomwabazyo; nimbaasa nta kukugambira kuzengyerera naitwe, ntarikumanya i ndikuza? Garukayo, ogarureyo na beene waanyu; MUKAMA abahe embabazi n'obwesigwa. <verse eid="2SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Itaayi yaagarukamu omugabe ati: Nindahira MUKAMA otahwaho, na mukama wangye omugabe, ei mukama wangye omugabe ariza, yaaba kufa nari okugumaho, naanye omwiru waawe niyo ndiza. <verse eid="2SA 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Daudi yaagira Itaayi ati: Irooko oyambukye. Atyo Itaayi owa Gaasi yaayambuka n'abantu be boona hamwe n'abaana boona abu yaabaire aine. <verse eid="2SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:2">2 Sam 16:2</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 17:16">17:16</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 17:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:1">Yoh 18:1</ref>. </char></note> Abantu boona ku baabaire nibarabaho, ab'omuri ekyo kyanga kyona baaborooga; bwanyima omugabe yaayambuka akagyera Kidirooni, n'abantu boona baagumizamu bagyemire omuhanda ogurikuza omu ihamba.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 22:20">1 Sam 22:20</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 8:17">2 Sam 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 20:25">20:25</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 4:15">Kub 4:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Abiasaari yaija, na Zadoki yaija n'aba Leevi boona baheekire eshanduukye y'endagaano ya Ruhanga; baahuumuza egyo shanduukye ya Ruhanga ahansi, okuhitsya obu abantu boona baarugire omu rurembo. <verse eid="2SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:13">Kur 15:13</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaagira Zadoki ati: Garura eshanduukye ya Ruhanga omu rurembo; MUKAMA ku arangirire embabazi, aryangarura, anyikirize ngireebe hamwe n'obutaaho bwe. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:18">1 Sam 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 9:9">9:9</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:8">Kub 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 17:17">2 Sam 17:17</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 22:20">22:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:19">Zab 18:19</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku araagire ati: Tindikukushemerererwa; ndi aha, angire oku arikwenda. <verse eid="2SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Omugabe yaagaruka yaagira Zadoki omunyamurwa ati: Tori omuhanuuzi? Garuka omu rurembo n'obusingye, iwe na Abiasaari n'abatabani baanyu bombi, Ahimaazi mutabani waawe, na Yonasaani mutabani we. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:16">2 Sam 17:16</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, niinyija kuguma aha nyambukiro y'omu ihamba, ntegyereize okuhitsya obu murantumeho kungambira. <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Zadoki na Abiasaari nikwo kuheeka eshanduukye ya Ruhanga, bakagigarura Yerusaalemu, bakagumayo. <verse eid="2SA 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Bwanyima Daudi yaatemba aharikwinamuka omu kibungo kya Zeituuni, yaagyenda naarira, ayetwekyereire, atajwaire nkaito; kandi n'abaabaire bari hamwe nawe boona baayetwekyerera, bainamuka nibarira. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:23">2 Sam 16:23</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 17:14">17:14</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 17:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Haagira owaagambira Daudi ku Ahisofeeli n'omwe aha beebumbire na Abusalomu. Daudi yaashaba ati: Ai MUKAMA, ninkweshengyereza, faafaatikanisa enaama ya Ahisofeeli.<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Daudi ku yaahikire aha mutwe gw'ekibungo ahu baabaire bashabira Ruhanga, Hushai mwene Aruki yaija kumubugana, ebijwaro bye bitaagukire, n'eitaka rimuri omu mutwe. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Daudi yaamugira ati: Ku oraagyende naanye, noija kundusya; <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:19">2 Sam 16:19</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ku oraagaarukye omu rurembo, waagira Abusalomu oti: Nyakusinga, niinyija kuba omwiru waawe; nk'oku naabaire ndi omwiru wa sho omu biro ebyahweire, na hati nikwo ndikwija kuba ahariiwe; noija kunsiisira enaama za Ahisofeeli. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:15">2 Sam 17:15</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 17:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Beitu torikwija kuba oineyo Zadoki na Abiasaari abanyamurwa? N'ahabw'ekyo eki oraahurire kyona ekirikuruga omu ka y'omugabe, okigambire Zadoki na Abiasaari abanyamurwa. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:17">1 Sam 17:17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi noomanya ku baineyo batabani baabo bombi, Ahimaazi mwene Zadoki na Yonasaani mwene Abiasaari; abo nibo murantumeho kungambira ebi muraabe mwahuriire byona. <verse eid="2SA 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:15">2 Sam 16:15</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 16:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 27:33">1 Bus 27:33</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Hushai munywani wa Daudi yaaza omu rurembo, yaashanga Abusalomu naataaha Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ziiba okuhwera Daudi n'okubeiherera Mefiboshesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 9:2-13">2 Sam 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:30">15:30</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 15:32">32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Daudi ku yaabaire yaahika aha mutwe gw'ekibungo, yaarengaho kakye, yaabugana Ziiba omugaragwa wa Mefiboshesi, aine endogoya ibiri eziriho amatandiiko, zeekoreire emigaati magana abiri, n'emitsitsa igana y'emizaabibu eyomire, n'endiijo igana ey'ebijuma by'omu kyanda, n'efurebe ya viinyo. <verse eid="2SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Omugabe yaabuuza Ziiba ati: Ebi n'ebya ki? Ziiba yaamugarukamu ati: Endogoya n'ez'okuheeka ab'omu ka y'omugabe, emigaati n'ebijuma by'omu kyanda n'eby'okufungurira abatsigazi, kandi na viinyo n'ey'okunywebwa abaraagwere enshazi omu ihamba. <verse eid="2SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Omugabe yaagaruka yaamubuuza ati: Beitu shi, mutabani wa mukama waawe arahi? Ziiba yaamugarukamu ati: Reeba, atsigaire Yerusaalemu; ahakuba agizire ati: Eri izooba enju ya Israeli neija kungarura aha ngoma ya tata. <verse eid="2SA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Omugabe yaagira Ziiba ati: Reeba, ebibaire biri ebya Mefiboshesi byona, hati n'ebyawe. Ziiba yaagira ati: Kasingye, Nyakusinga omugabe. Ngume ngirirwe ntyo embabazi omu maisho gaawe.<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shimei okujuma Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 19:16">2 Sam 19:16</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 19:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:8">1 Bag 2:8</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 2:36-46">36-46</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omugabe Daudi ku yaahikire haihi na Bahurimu, haarugayo omushaija ow'omu muryango gw'enju ya Saulo orikwetwa Shimei mwene Geera; yaija naamukyeena; <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />yaarekyera Daudi n'abagaragwa be boona amabaare; abantu boona n'abashaija be amamanzi bakaba bamushagatiire aha rubaju rwa buryo n'orwa bumosho. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Shimei ku yaabaire naamukyeena, yaaguma naagira ati: Rugaho, rugaho, iwe mwitani 'we, ekishaija kitaine mugasho. <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:16">2 Sam 1:16</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA akutuzire eshagama y'enju ya Saulo yoona, ou waahunguriire, okaza aha ngoma ye; mbwenu MUKAMA ahaire Abusalomu mutabani waawe obugabe bwawe; reeba, otuzirwe eitima ryawe, ahakuba ori omwitani.<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:28">Kur 22:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abishai mwene Zeruiya yaagira omugabe ati: Ahabw'enki nitureka egi mbwa efiire kujuma mukama wangye omugabe? Ninkweshengyereza, reka nyambukye, mmutemeho omutwe. <verse eid="2SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 26:6">1 Sam 26:6</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 19:22">2 Sam 19:22</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 2:16">1 Bus 2:16</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaati ati: Nyine kakwate ki naimwe, imwe beene Zeruiya? MUKAMA ku araabe niwe amugizire ati: Kyeena Daudi, mbwenu n'oha oraamugire ati: Ahabw'enki waakora otyo? <verse eid="2SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:11">2 Sam 12:11</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagira Abishai n'abagaragwa be boona ati: Nimureeba mutabani wangye ou nyezaariire nampiiga kuunyita; kaashwa ogu Mubenyamiini. Nimumurekye akyeene, ahakuba MUKAMA amuragiire. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Obundi MUKAMA akaareeba oku ndikwitwa kubi, arugaho anzimuurira ebirungi ahabw'oku kukyeenwa oku naakyeenwa eri izooba. <verse eid="2SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Atyo Daudi n'abashaija be baagumya omuhanda, na Shimei yaakiikama omu rukiizi rw'ekibungo seeri yaabo naamukyeena, naamurekyera amabaare n'omucuucu. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Bwanyima omugabe n'abantu boona abu yaabaire aine, baahika Yorudani baruhire; omugabe yaaruhuukirayo.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abusalomu okwehanuuza ahari Ahisofeeli na Hushai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Abusalomu n'Abaisraeli boona baahika Yerusaalemu hamwe na Ahisofeeli. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:24">1 Sam 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:37">2 Sam 15:37</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 1:25">1 Bag 1:25</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 1:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 11:12">2 Bag 11:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Hushai mwene Aruki, munywani wa Daudi, yaija owa Abusalomu, yaamugira ati: Omugabe nakaramaare! Omugabe nakaramaare! <verse eid="2SA 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Abusalomu yaabuuza Hushai ati: Obwo nibwo bwesigwa obu oine ahari munywani waawe? Ekikuzibiire kugyenda nawe n'enki? <verse eid="2SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Hushai yaagira Abusalomu ati: Ngaaha! Kureka omuntu otoorainwe MUKAMA n'aba bantu n'Abaisraeli boona, niwe ndiba owe, kandi niwe ndiguma nawe. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:34">2 Sam 15:34</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ekindi, n'oha ou nshemereire kuheereza? T'omutabani? Nk'oku naabaire mpeereza sho, naiwe nikwo ndikuheereza.<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Bwanyima Abusalomu yaagira Ahisofeeli ati: Tuhe obwengye, oku turaatwaze. <verse eid="2SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:16">2 Sam 15:16</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 20:3">20:3</ref>. </char></note> Ahisofeeli yaagira Abusalomu ati: Irooko obyame n'ebinyanshunju bya sho, ebi atsigiire eka ye kugirinda; haza Abaisraeli boona nibaija kumanyira aho ku otamirwe sho; n'ahabw'ekyo abu oine boona nibaija kuhama. <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:11">2 Sam 12:11</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 12:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baateerera Abusalomu eihema aha mutwe gw'enju; Abusalomu yaaritaahamu, yaabyama n'ebinyanshunju bya ishe, Abaisraeli boona nibakireeba. <verse eid="2SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:12">2 Sam 15:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omu biro ebyo obwengye obu Ahisofeeli yaabaire aha, bukaba buba nk'obu omuntu ahairwe Ruhanga; okwo nikwo obwengye bwa Ahisofeeli bwabaire busiimwa Daudi, kandi na Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Hushai okufaafaatikanisa enaama ya Ahisofeeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Kandi Ahisofeeli yaagaruka yaagira Abusalomu ati: Ka ntoorane engabo kakumi n'enkumi ibiri, nyimukye, nkurate Daudi eki kiro; <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:14">2 Sam 16:14</ref>. </char></note> niinyija kumugwaho aruhire, atakiine maani, mmutiinise, abantu boona abu aine bahungye, nyite omugabe wenka; <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />haza abantu boona mbakugarurire. Manya eki orikwenda n'okwita omuntu omwe, reero abantu boona bakagira obusingye. <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Enaama egyo yaasiimwa Abusalomu n'abakuru ba Israeli boona.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 16:16-18">2 Sam 16:16-18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Abusalomu yaagira ati: Mwete Hushai mwene Aruki, nawe tuhurire eki arikugamba. <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Hushai ku yaahikire ahari Abusalomu, Abusalomu yaamugira ati: Ahisofeeli yaatugambira ati n'ati; mbwenu tukore nk'oku yaagamba? Ku oraabe otarikukisiima, naiwe otugambire. <verse eid="2SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Hushai yaagarukamu Abusalomu ati: Obwengye obu Ahisofeeli yaaha eri izooba ti burungi. <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Kandi yaagaruka yaagira ati: noomanya sho n'engabo ze ku bari amamanzi; kandi hati bashaariire nk'edubu eyaayakwa ebyana byayo omu ihamba; kandi sho aba rugambwa omu kurwana, tarikwenda kuraara mu bantu. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Mbwenu ayesherekire omu kiina nari ahandi. N'ahabw'ekyo ku haraagire abaafa nibakitandika kurwana, oraakihurire weena naija kugira ati: Hafiire abantu baingi omu ba Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Ekyo nikyija kureetera omuntu weena kuhahaara, n'obu yaakuba ari emanzi aine omutima nk'ogw'entare, ahabw'okuba Abaisraeli boona nibamanya sho ku ari emanzi, kandi n'abu aine boona ku bari amamanzi. <verse eid="2SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:10">2 Sam 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">Kut 22:17</ref>. </char></note> Kureka nyowe obwengye obu ndikukuha n'obu. Teeranira hamwe Abaisraeli boona, okutandikira Daani okuhika Beeri-sheba, baingane n'omusheenyi gw'aha rubaju rw'enyanja obwingi, kandi naiwe wenka ohurure nabo. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Tutyo nitwija kumugwaho ahu turaamushangye hoona, tumutondeho nk'oku orume rutonda ahansi; we n'abantu abu aine boona, titurikwija kutsigaho n'omwe. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Kandi ku araahungire omu rurembo, nabwo Abaisraeli boona nibaija kureeta emirunga, turukumbagaze omu ruhanga, okuhitsya obu ruraahweho, hatatsigareho kabaare na kamwe. <verse eid="2SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:31">2 Sam 15:31</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 15:34">34</ref>. </char></note> Abusalomu n'Abaisraeli boona baagira bati: obwengye bwa Hushai mwene Aruki bwakira obwa Ahisofeeli. Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akaba ataireho enaama y'okushiisha obwengye burungi bwa Ahisofeeli, ngu abone kureetera Abusalomu akabi.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batabani b'abanyamurwa okugambira Daudi enaama za Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 15:35">2 Sam 15:35</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 15:36">36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Hushai yaagira Zadoki na Abiasaari abanyamurwa ati: Obwengye obu Ahisofeeli ahaire Abusalomu n'abakuru ba israeli n'obu; kwonka nyowe obu mmuhaire ni buti na buti. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:28">2 Sam 15:28</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mutume juba ahari Daudi muti: Eki kiro otaraara aha nyambukiro y'eihamba; oyambukye, hatagira ekyakuzibira, omugabe atakaamirwa n'abantu abu aine boona. <verse eid="2SA 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:27">2 Sam 15:27</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 15:36">36</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Yonasaani na Ahimaazi bakaba bari Eni-rogeli bategyereize; omuzaana yaaguma naija naabibagambira, nabo nibaza kubigambira omugabe Daudi; ahakuba bakaba batarikwikirizibwa kutaaha omu rurembo nibareebwa. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Kwonka haagira omwojo owaabareeba, yaagambira Abusalomu. Abo batsigazi bombi baagyenda nibeehuta, baahika Bahurimu, baataaha omu nju y'omushaija owaabaire aine eiziba omu kibuga kye; baarizamu. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:6">Yos 2:6</ref>. </char></note> Omukazi yaagira ekifundikizo, yaakita aha munwa gwaryo, yaakyanikaho omushekure gw'engano; tikyamanywa. <verse eid="2SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Abambari ba Abusalomu baahika aha nju, baabuuza omukazi bati: Ahimaazi na Yonasaani barahi? Omukazi yaabagarukamu ati: Baayambuka akagyera. Ku baabasherwire, baabura, baagaruka Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:15">2 Sam 17:15</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 17:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Ku baaherize kugyenda, abo batsigazi baaruga omu iziba, baagyenda, baagambira Daudi ebi batumirwe; baamugira bati: Mwimukye, murahukye kwambuka omugyera, ahakuba Ahisofeeli aine enaama eti n'eti y'okubarwanisa. <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Atyo Daudi yaimuka n'abantu abu yaabaire aine boona, baayambuka Yorudani; omushekye ku gwagiire kujuguta, haashangwa hatakiine n'omwe otakambukire.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 15:12">2 Sam 15:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:5">Mat 27:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahisofeeli ku yaareebire obwengye bwe butaikirizibwa, yaatandiika endogoya ye, yaimuka, yaataaha owe omu rurembo rw'owaabo; yaatebeekanisa eby'omu ka ye, yaayehanika, yaafa, baamuziika omu kituuro kya ishe.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 32:2">Kut 32:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Daudi yaahika Mahanaimu. Abusalomu nawe yaayambuka Yorudani n'Abaisraeli boona. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:13">2 Sam 19:13</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 20:9">20:9</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 20:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:5">1 Bag 2:5</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 2:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 2:13">1 Bus 2:13</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 2:16">16</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 2:17">17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Abusalomu akaba ataireho Amasa kuba omukuru w'eihe omu mwanya gwa Yoabu. Kandi Amasa ogwo akaba ari mutabani w'omushaija orikwetwa Itura Omuishimaeli, owaashweire Abigaili muhara wa Nahashi, murumuna wa Zeruiya nyina wa Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Bwanyima Abaisraeli na Abusalomu baasiisira omu nsi ya Gileadi.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 9:4">2 Sam 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 10:1">10:1</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 10:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 19:31">19:31</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 19:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:7">1 Bag 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 2:61">Ezr 2:61</ref>. </char>
    </note> Daudi ku yaahikire Mahanaimu, Shobi mwene Nahashi owa Rabba ey'Abaamoni, na Makiri mwene Amieli owa Lodebaari, na Baruzilai Omunyagileadi owa Rogelimu, <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />baareeta ebitanda, enyabya, enyungu, engano, sayiri, esaano, engano zikarangire, ebihimba, enkoore zikarangire, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:2">2 Sam 16:2</ref>. </char></note> obwoki, amajuta, entaama n'encumate za ciizi, baabireetera Daudi n'abantu abu yaabaire aine kubafungurira; ahakuba bakagira bati: Abantu baine enjara, baruhire, kandi baitiirwe eiriho omu ihamba.<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Daudi yaabara abantu abu yaabaire aine, yaataho abantu kuba abakuru b'engabo rukumi-rukumi n'aba igana-igana. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:19">2 Sam 15:19</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaba engabo, ekicweka kimwe kya kashatu yaakiha Yoabu, ekindi yaakiha Abishai mwene Zeruiya, murumuna wa Yoabu, n'ekindi yaakiha Itaayi owa Gaasi. Omugabe yaagira abantu ati: Naanye ahabwangye niinyija kuhurura naimwe. <verse eid="2SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:17">2 Sam 21:17</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abantu baamugira bati: Iwe torikwija kuhurura; ahabw'okuba ku turaahungye, tibarikwija kutufaho; nangwa n'obu ekicweka kimwe kya kabiri ky'abantu baintu kyakufa, nabwo tibakaatufaho; ahakube iwe noingana n'abantu baitu kakumi; n'ahabw'ekyo haakiri ogume omu rurembo, otwoherereze ab'okutuha emikono. <verse eid="2SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Omugabe yaabagira ati: Eki murikusiima nikyo ndaakore. Bwanyima omugabe yaayemerera aha irembo, engabo zoona nizishohora omu mitwe ya igana-igana na rukumi-rukumi. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:12">2 Sam 18:12</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaayehangangiriza Yoabu na Abishai na Itaayi ati: Mutwaze gye ogwo mwojo Abusalomu ahabwangye. Kandi abantu boona baahurira omugabe naayehanangiriza abakuru b'engabo ebya Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 18:17">2 Sam 18:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 17:15">Yos 17:15</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 17:18">18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Batyo abantu baaza kurwanira n'Abaisraeli omu ishwa; orugamba rwatengyerwa omu kibira kya Efuraimu. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Abaisraeli baasingurirwayo abashaija ba Daudi; kandi eryo izooba haafa abantu obukumi bubiri, <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />ahakuba orugamba rukaba rujanjaire omuri egyo ensi yoona; eryo izooba ekibira kyamara abantu baingi okukira abaitsirwe rurara.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 14:26">2 Sam 14:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abusalomu yaabugaabugana n'abashaija ba Daudi atakimanyire. Kandi Abusalomu akaba atembire enyumbu ye; egyo nyumbu yaamurabya ahansi y'amataagi g'omwela muhango agakwataine; omutwe gwe gwakwatirwa omuri ago mataagi, yaaguma, naareereetera omu mwanya, enyumbu ei yaabaire atembire yaagumizamu. <verse eid="2SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Omushaija yaamureeba, yaagambira Yoabu ati: Naareeba Abusalomu ari omu mwela naareereeta. <verse eid="2SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Yoabu yaabuuza owaamugambira ati: Ot'enki! Waamureeba! Ahabw'enki otaamucumita, okamutuura ahansi? Naaba ninkuha ebicweka by'efeeza ikumi n'orukoba. <verse eid="2SA 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:5">2 Sam 18:5</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo mushaija yaagarukamu Yoabu ati: N'obu naakuheebwa ebicweka by'efeeza rukumi, tinkaabanga mukono gwangye kwita omwana w'omugabe; ahakuba twahurira omugabe naakwehanangiriza iwe, na Abishai na Itaayi ati: Mwerinde, hatagira owaakora ahari ogwo mwojo Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Kandi hoona kuri naabitwaza okundi, nkamureebya, (manya omugabe tagira ki asherekwa,) iwe waaba noija kubyejuura. <verse eid="2SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Yoabu yaagira ati: Tinaaza kusiisira mwanya gwangye busha ningamba naiwe. Yaakwata emyambi eshatu omu ngaro, yaagitimbura Abusalomu omu mutima, akiri omu mwela ahuriire. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Bwanyima abatsigazi ikumi abatwazi b'eby'okurwanisa bya Yoabu baayehinguririza Abusalomu, baamurezya, yaafa.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Yoabu yaateera enzamba, engabo zaagaruka, zaareereera kukurata Abaisraeli, ahabw'okuzibirwa Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:26">Yos 7:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 8:29">8:29</ref>. </char></note> Baatwara Abusalomu, baamunaga omu kiina kihango ky'omu kibira, baamurundaho ekirundo kihango munonga ky'amabaare; Abaisraeli baahunga, buri muntu yaaza omu ka ye.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 14:27">2 Sam 14:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 14:17">Kut 14:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:18">28:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Abusalomu, obu yaabaire akihuriire, akatwara enyomyo, yaagibyara omu ruhanga rw'omugabe; ahabw'okuba akagira ati: Tiinyine mwana w'omwojo, ou bariijukiraho eiziina ryangye; kandi egyo nyomyo yaagyeyeterera; n'okuhitsya hati neekyetwa enyomo y'ekiijutsyo kya Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugabe okubikirwa Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 15:36">2 Sam 15:36</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 18:31">18:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Ahimaazi mwene Zadoki yaagira ati: ka nyirukye ngambire omugabe ag'aha rugamba, n'oku MUKAMA yaamuhoorera enzigu aha bazigu be. <verse eid="2SA 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Yoabu yaamugira ati: Otaza kugamba amakuru eri izooba, kureka ogagambe obundi. Kwonka eri izooba orekye kugagamba, ahabw'okuba omwana w'omugabe yaafa. <verse eid="2SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Yoabu yaagira Omukuushi ati: Irooko ogyende, ogambire omugabe ebi waareeba. Atyo Omukuushi yainama omu maisho ga Yoabu, yairuka. <verse eid="2SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Ahimaazi mwene Zadoki yaagaruka yaagira Yoabu ati: Ninkweshengyereza, ka nyirukye nkurate oriya Mukuushi, oku biraabe bibekwo. Yoabu yaagira ati: Noirukibwa ki, mwana wangye, ka noomanya ku otakiheebwa bihembo ahabw'ago makuru? <verse eid="2SA 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 34:3">Bir 34:3</ref>. </char></note> Onu yaagira ati: Ekiraabe kyabaire kibe, naaza kugyenda. Yoabu ati: Iruka. Atyo Ahimaazi yairuka, yaatoora ogw'oruhita, yaatangayo Omukuushi.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 13:34">2 Sam 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 19:8">19:8</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:17">2 Bag 9:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Daudi akaba ashutami ahagati y'amarembo abiri; omurinzi yaatemba aha mutwe gw'eirembo, yaayemerera aha rugo rw'amabaare; ku yaanagire amaisho, yaareeba omuntu nairuka wenka. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Omurinzi yaayeta, yaagambira omugabe. Omugabe yaagira ati: ku araabe ari wenka, aine amakuru agu areetsire. Ogwo muntu yaija naayehuuta, yaahika haihi. <verse eid="2SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Bwanyima omurinzi yaareeba ondiijo mushaija nairuka; yaayeta omukumiirizi, yaamugira ati: Reeba ondiijo mushaija nairuka wenka. Omugabe yaagira ati: Nawe areetsire amakuru. <verse eid="2SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Omurinzi yaagira ati: Okundikureeba, okwiruka kw'oyebembeire nikushusha okwa Ahimaazi mwene Zadoki. Omugabe yaagira ati: Ava omushaija murungi, naija kureeta amakuru marungi.<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 14:20">Kut 14:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahimaazi yaagambira omugabe n'eiraka rihango, ati: Huumura, ni buhooro. Yainama omu maisho g'omugabe, yaagira ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ahimbisibwe, ohaireyo abashaija ababaire babangire emikono kurwanisa mukama wangye omugabe. <verse eid="2SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Omugabe yaamubuuza ati: Omwojo ori Abusalomu ari buhooro? Ahimaazi yaagarukamu ati: Yoabu obu yantuma, nyowe omwiru waawe naareeba abantu nibayogoorekana; kwonka tinaamanya kyaba kiriho. <verse eid="2SA 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Omugabe yaamugira ati: Hingura, oyemerere aha. Atyo yaahingura, yaayemerera.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 18:19">2 Sam 18:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ogwo Mukuushi yaija, yaagira ati: Ndeeteire mukama wangye omugabe amakuru; ahakuba eri izooba MUKAMA yaakuhoorera enzigu aha bantu boona ababaire baimukire kukurwanisa. <verse eid="2SA 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:4">2 Sam 19:4</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaabuuza Omukuushi ati: Omwojo ori Abusalomu ari buhooro? Omukuushi yaamugarukamu ati: Abazigu ba mukama wangye omugabe, n'abantu boona abaimukire kukukora kubi, nibakabe nk'ogwo mwojo. <verse eid="2SA 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Omugabe yaashaasha munonga, yaatemba omu kishengye ky'aha mutwe gw'eirembo, yaarira; ku yaabaire naagyenda, yaagyenda naagira ati: Ai bambe omwana wangye Abusalomu! Omwana wangye, Omwana wangye Abusalomu! Kuri niinye naafa omu mwanya gwawe, ai bambe Abusalomu, mwana wangye, mwana wangye!<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okuhanwa Yoabu ahabw'okucurira omutabani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Bwanyima baagira Yoabu bati: Reeba, omugabe naacurira Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Eryo izooba okwesiima kw'obusinguzi kwahinduka okucura omu bantu boona; ahakuba eryo izooba abantu bakahurira ngu omugabe ari omu naku ahabw'omwana we. <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Kandi abantu baagaruka omu rurembo nibashobooka, nk'abantu abacwire aha rugamba oku bashoobooka baine enshoni. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:30">2 Sam 15:30</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 18:33">18:33</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaayetwekyerera ahamaisho, yaacura n'eiraka rihango ati: Ai bambe omwana wangye Abusalomu, Abusalomu, mwana wangye, mwana wangye! <verse eid="2SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Yoabu yaataaha omu nju, yaahika omugabe, yaamugira ati: Eri izooba waahemura abagaragwa baawe boona, abakirize amagara gaawe hati, n'aga batabani baawe na bahara baawe, kandi n'ag'abakazi baawe n'ebinyanshunju byawe; <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />ahabw'okuba nookunda abarikukwanga, nooyanga abarikukunda. Mbwenu waayorekyera kimwe ku abakuru b'engabo n'abagaragwa baawe bari busha ahariiwe; hati naamanya ngu, kuri Abusalomu agumireho, abandi twena tukafa eri izooba, kuri nooyesiima munonga. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Mbwenu hati imuka, oshohore, ogambe gye n'abairu baawe; ahakuba nindahira MUKAMA, ku oraabe otashohoire, tihariho mushaija n'omwe, oraatsigare naiwe eki kiro; kandi kiryakurugiramu akabi okukira akabi koona aku orareebire okwiha omu buto bwawe n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="2SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:4">2 Sam 18:4</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 18:17">17</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 18:24">24</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 18:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 4:1">Rus 4:1</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe nikwo kwimuka, akashutama aha irembo, bakagambira abantu boona bati: Reeba, omugabe ashutami aha irembo. Bwanyima abantu boona baija kutabaarira omugabe.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="2SA 19:8">Abaisraeli n'Abayuda okucuma enaama y'okugarura Daudi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Obwo Abaisraeli boona bakaba bahungire, buri muntu agarukire omu ka ye. <verse eid="2SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:20">2 Sam 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 8:1-14">8:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:14">15:14</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abantu boona ab'enganda zoona z'Abaisraeli baagarukanamu nibagira bati: Omugabe niwe yaatwihire omu mikono y'abazigu baitu, akatukiza Abafilistia; mbwenu ahungire Abusalomu yaaruga aha ngoma. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Na Abusalomu ou twashukireho amajuta kututegyeka, agwire omu rugamba. Mbwenu nimuzibirwa ki kuhanuura aha by'okugarura omugabe?<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 15:29">2 Sam 15:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe Daudi yaatuma ahari Zadoki na Abiasaari abanyamurwa naagira ati: Mubuuze abakuru b'Abayuda muti: Ahabw'enki niiwe mwaza kuheererukira abandi kugarura omugabe omu ka ye, haza enaama, ei Abaisraeli boona bacumire kumugarura, emuhikire. <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:25">2 Sam 17:25</ref>. </char></note> Niimwe beene tata; niimwe baitu ab'aha mara; mbwenu ahabw'enki mwaza kuheererukira abandi kugarura omugabe? <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:16">2 Sam 8:16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi mugambire na Amasa muti: Torikumanya iwe naanye ku turi ab'enda emwe? Ku oraabe otabaire omukuru w'eihe ryangye okuruga hati omu mwanya gwa Yoabu, Ruhanga akinture n'okukiraho. <verse eid="2SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Yaayekubuurira emitima y'Abayuda boona nk'omutima gw'omuntu omwe. Ekyarugiremu baatuma aha mugabe bati: Garuka n'abagaragwa baawe boona. <verse eid="2SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Atyo omugabe yaagaruka, yaahika ahari Yorudani. Abayuda baaza Gilugaali kumubugana kumwambutsya Yorudani.<verse eid="2SA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shimei okushaba omugabe kumusaasira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 16:5">2 Sam 16:5</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:8">1 Bag 2:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Shimei mwene Geera Omubenyamiini owa Bahurimu yaayehuuta, yaashuuma n'Abayuda kubugana omugabe Daudi, <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:2">2 Sam 9:2</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 9:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref>. </char></note> aine abashaija rukumi b'Ababenyamiini, na Ziiba omugaragwa w'enju ya Saulo n'abatabani n'abairu be makumi abiri; baayambuka Yorudani omugabe naabareeba. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Obwato bwasiiba nibwambutsya ab'omu ka y'omugabe, n'okukora eki arikwenda. Omugabe ku yaaherize kwambuka Yorudani, Shimei mwene Geera yaajuumara ahansi omu maisho ge. <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:5">2 Sam 16:5</ref>. </char></note> Yaagira omugabe ati: Nyakusinga omugabe, otambarira okutahikiirira, kandi otaijuka eki omwiru waawe yaakozire n'obugomi aha izooba eri waarugiireho Yerusaalemu, mukama wangye, kandi birekye kukusaasa. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:5">2 Sam 16:5</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nyowe, omwiru waawe, nimmanya ku naacumwire; nikyo eri izooba naabandiza ab'enju ya Yosefu boona kushuuma kubugana mukama wangye omugabe. <verse eid="2SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Kur 22:28</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Abishai mwene Zeruiya yaagira ati: Beitu Shimei tarikwija kwitwa, ahabw'okujuma ou MUKAMA yaashukireho amajuta? <verse eid="2SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 11:13">1 Sam 11:13</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 16:10">2 Sam 16:10</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagira ati: Mbwenu imwe beene Zeruiya, nyine kakwate ki naimwe, mwaza kuunyimukiza obuzigu eri izooba? Nimugira ngu hariho ow'okwitwa omuri Israeli eri izooba? Nari shi tindikumanya ku ndi omugabe wa Israeli eri izooba? <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:8">1 Bag 2:8</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 2:9">9</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 2:37">37</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 2:46">46</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaagira Shimei ati: Torikwija kufa. Yaamurahira.<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya Mefiboshesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 9:6">2 Sam 9:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Mefiboshesi mwene Saulo yaashuuma kubugana omugabe; kandi okwiha obu omugabe yaagyenda okuhitsya aha izooba eri yaagarukiireho omuka n'obusingye, akaba atakanaabaga bigyere, nari okutuubya aha bireju, n'obu kwakuba okwozya ebijwaro bye. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Ku yaahikire Yerusaalemu kubugana omugabe, omugabe yaamubuuza ati: Beitu Mefiboshesi, n'enki ekyakuzibiire kugyenda naanye? <verse eid="2SA 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:3">2 Sam 9:3</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugarukamu ati: Nyakusinga omugabe, omwiru wangye akambeiha; ahakuba nyowe omwiru waawe nkaba ngizire nti: Niinyija kutandiika endogoya, ngizeho, ngyende n'omugabe, ahakuba omwiru waawe ndi ekimuga. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:17">2 Sam 14:17</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 14:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 16:3">16:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi akambeiherera ahari mukama wangye; kwonka mukama wangye omugabe ni nka maraika wa Ruhanga; omugabe n'ahabw'ekyo okore eki orikusiima. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:7">2 Sam 9:7</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 9:10">10</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 9:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ab'omu ka ya tata boona bakaba bacwereirwe orubanja rw'okufa omu maisho ga mukama wangye omugabe; haza wanshutamya n'abarikuriira aha meeza yaawe. Mbwenu nimbaasa nta kugaruka kutakira omugabe? <verse eid="2SA 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Omugabe yaamugira ati: Ahabw'enki noogaruka omu bigambo? Naabiheza. Iwe na Ziiba mubagane ekibanja. <verse eid="2SA 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Mefiboshesi yaagira omugabe ati: Iwe, reka akitware kyona, niho mukama wangye omugabe yaagaruka omu ka ye n'obusingye.<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi okusiima Baruzilai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 2:7">1 Bag 2:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Baruzilai Omunyagileadi yaashuuma naaruga Rogelimu, yaayambuka Yorudani n'omugabe kumuhitsya seeri. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:27-29">2 Sam 17:27-29</ref>. </char></note> Baruzilai ogwo akaba ari omugurusi munonga aine emyaka makumi munaana; kandi niwe yaabaire agyemurira omugabe obu yaabaire ari Mahanaimu; ahakuba akaba ari omushaija ohamire. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Omugabe yaagira Baruzilai ati: Ija twambukane, tuze Yerusaalemu; niinyija kugama ninkuriisa. <verse eid="2SA 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Kwonka Baruzilai yaagira omugabe ati: Ntsigaizeyo emyaka engahi, eyaakungyema kwinamuka n'omugabe Yerusaalemu? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 90:10">Zab 90:10</ref>. </char></note> Eri izooba naahitsya emyaka makumi munaana. Mbwenu ninkibaasa kutaanisa ekirungi n'ekibi? Omwiru waawe naakinurirwa ebi arikurya nari ebi arikunywa? Nkiine agahurira amaraka g'abashaija nari abakazi abarikweshongora? Mbwenu omwiru waawe asiibe naaruhiza ki mukama wangye omugabe? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Omwiru waawe k'afe okwambuka n'omugabe Yorudani, amuhitsye hariya seeri. Ahabw'enki omugabe ashemereire kumpa ebihembo ebirikwinga bityo? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:7">1 Bag 2:7</ref>. </char></note> Ninkweshengyereza, nyowe omwiru waawe ka ngarukyeyo, ngwe omu rurembo rw'owaitu, ahu ekituuro kya tata na maawe kiri. Kwonka reeba omwiru waawe Kimuhaamu ngugu; abe niwe yaayambuka na mukama wangye omugabe, omutwaze nk'oku orikwenda. <verse eid="2SA 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Omugabe yaamugarukamu ati: Mbwenu Kimuhaamu naarabeho twambukye; niinyija kuguma nimmukorera, eki orikwenda kyona; kandi naiwe eki orinshaba kyona, ndyakikukorera. <verse eid="2SA 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Batyo abantu boona baayambuka Yorudani; n'omugabe nawe yaayambuka. Omugabe yaanywegyera Baruzilai, yaamushabira omugisha; bwanyima onu yaagaruka owaabo. <verse eid="2SA 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Okwo nikwo omugabe yaayambukire, akaza Gilugaali, na Kimuhaamu akambuka nawe. Batyo Abayuda boona hamwe n'ekicweka ky'Abaisraeli baayambutsya omugabe.<verse eid="2SA 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 19:15">2 Sam 19:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Abaisraeli boona baija aha mugabe, baamugira bati: Ahabw'enki beene waitu Abayuda baakutwaire bwesherekye, bakakwambutsya Yorudani n'ab'eka yaawe boona n'abagaragwa baawe boona? <verse eid="2SA 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:12">2 Sam 19:12</ref>. </char></note> Abayuda boona baagarukamu Abaisraeli bati: N'ahabw'okuba omugabe aine obuzaare bwa haihi naitwe. Beitu shi imwe kibagwisiize ki kubi? Nimugira ngu twine eky'omugabe eki turiire? Nari shi hariho ekiconco kyona eki atuhaire? <verse eid="2SA 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:30">1 Bag 11:30</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:31">31</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli baagarukamu Abayuda bati: Itwe twine emigabo ikumi omu mugabe, kandi Daudi n'owaitu kukira imwe. Mbwenu shi mutugayiire ki? Tiitwe tubandize kuhanuura eby'okugarura omugabe waitu? Kwonka ebigambo by'Abayuda byashaarira okukira eby'Abaisraeli.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'obugomi bwa Sheeba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:16">1 Bag 12:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 10:16">2 Bus 10:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu bunaku obwo hakabaho omushaija otaine ku ari, orikwetwa Sheeba mwene Bikuri Omubenyamiini; yaateera enzamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">Titwine mugabo omuri Daudi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">N'obu bwakuba obuhunguzi omuri mwene Yese.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">Imwe Baisraeli 'mwe, buri muntu agarukye omu ihema rye!<verse eid="2SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />N'ahabw'ekyo Abaisraeli boona baarereera kukuratira Daudi, baakuratira Sheeba mwene Bikuri; kwonka Abayuda, okuruga Yorudani okuhika Yerusaalemu baahamira aha mugabe waabo.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 15:16">2 Sam 15:16</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 16:21">16:21</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 16:22">22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe Daudi yaataha omu nju ye omuri Yerusaalemu; yaatwara abakazi be b'ebinyanshunju, abu yaabaire atsigiire eka ye kugirinda, yaabata omu nju y'okurindirwamu, yaaguma naabaha eby'okubatunga, kwonka tiyaagaruka kubaraarira. Batyo baaguma nibarindwa okuhitsya obu baafiire, bari nk'abafaakazi.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 17:25">2 Sam 17:25</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 19:13">19:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe yaagira Amasa ati: Nyetera Abayuda, bateeranire aha ebiro bishatu bitakahweire, haza naiwe obeho. <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Atyo Amasa yaaza kuhuruza Abayuda; kwonka yaarenzya ebiro ebi omugabe yaamuragiire. <verse eid="2SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Daudi nikwo kugira Abishai ati: Mbwenu ho Sheeba mwene Bikuri yaaza kutukora kubi okukira Abusalomu; irooko otware abashaija ba mukama waawe, mumukurate, atakaakubuura endembo ezizitiirwe n'engo z'amabaare, akaguma naatuganzya. <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Abishai yaahurura akuratiirwe abashaija ba Yoabu n'aba Keresi n'aba Pelesi n'amamanzi goona; baaruga Yerusaalemu, kukurata Sheeba mwene Bikuri. <verse eid="2SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Ku baahikire aha ibaare rihango rya Gibeoni, Amasa yaija kubabugana. Obwo Yoabu akaba ajwaire ebijwaro by'orugamba, abyezirikiise orukoba, oruriho rurara eri aha nyugunyu omu kyobati kyayo; ku yairiireho omu maisho, rurara yaaragara. <verse eid="2SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Yoabu yaagira Amasa ati: Ni buhooro, mwana wa tata? Yoabu yaakwata ekireju kya Amasa n'omukono gwe gwa buryo kumunywegyera. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:5">1 Bag 2:5</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Amasa tiyaayeta hari rurara ei Yoabu yaabaire akwaitse; Yoabu nikwo kugimutimbura aha nda, amara ge gakeeshuka ahansi, atagarukye kugimuteera bundi. Atyo Amasa yaafa. Bwanyima Yoabu na Abishai omurumuna baagumizamu kukurata Sheeba mwene Bikuri.<verse eid="2SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Omwe aha bashaija ba Yoabu yaayemerera aha rubaju rwa Amasa, yaagira ati: Orikukunda Yoabu, kandi ori aha rubaju rwa Daudi, akuratire Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Obwo Amasa akaba agarami omu shagama naashamba, ahagati y'omuhanda rugyendwa. Ogwo mushaija ku yaareebire abantu boona baayemerera aho, yaakiriza Amasa, yaamwiha omu muhanda, yaamurambika omu kishaka, yaamushweka ekijwaro. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Ku baamwihire omu muhanda, abantu boona baakuratira Yoabu kuza kusherura Sheeba mwene Bikuri.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Sheeba ogwo yaaraba omu nganda za Israeli zoona, yaahika Abeeli eya Besi-maaka, aba Bikuri boona baateerana, baamukurata. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Abashaija boona aba Yoabu baamugotera Abeeli eya Besi-maaka; baatuuma omutuumo gw'eitaka aha rugo rw'amabaare rw'orurembo; baatandika kuteera orugo kurukumbagaza. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Bwanyima omukazi omunyabwengye w'omuri orwo rurembo yaagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Yeimwe nimuhurire, mbagambire! Mungirire Yoabu muti: Ija kunu, akugambire. <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Yoabu yaamuhika haihi; ogwo mukazi yaamubuuza ati: Ori Yoabu? Onu ati: Ndi we. Omukazi yaamugira ati: Hurira ebigambo by'omuzaana waawe. Onu ati: Nimpurira. <verse eid="2SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Yaagira ati: ira bakaba bagira ngu, Ka baze kwehanuuza omuri Abeeli. Batyo bamarirayo ekibashobeire. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Nyowe ndi omwe ahari abo abakunda obusingye, kandi abarikwesigwa omuri Israeli. Mbwenu nooyenda kucwekyereza orurembo n'omuzaire omuri Israeli. Ahabw'enki nooyenda kumaraho obuhunguzi bwa MUKAMA? <verse eid="2SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Yoabu yaamugarukamu ati: nikikabure! Nikikabure nyowe okumaraho nari okucwekyereza. <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:33">Yos 24:33</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo tikwo kiri. Kureka hariho omushaija ow'omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, orikwetwa Sheeba mwene Bikuri, owaabangire omukono gwe kurwanisa omugabe Daudi. Mube niwe mwahayo wenka, mbone kubarugira aha rurembo. Ogwo mukazi yaagira Yoabu ati: Reeba, omutwe gwe twaza kugukutambikira, tugurenzye orugo. <verse eid="2SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:16">2 Sam 20:16</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho ogwo mukazi yaagaruka aha bantu baamwo boona n'obwo bwengye bwe, baatemaho Sheeba mwene Bikuri omutwe, baagutambikira Yoabu. Yoabu yaateera enzamba, abantu boona baataataana, baaruga aha rurembo, buri muntu yaagaruka omu ka ye. Na Yoabu yaatabaaruka, yaaza Yerusaalemu ow'omugabe.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:16-18">2 Sam 8:16-18</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 4:3-6">1 Bag 4:3-6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu bunaku obwo Yoabu niwe yaabaire ari omukuru w'eihe ryona erya Israeli; na Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada ari omukuru w'aba Keresi n'aba Pelesi; <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adoraamu ari omushorooza mukuru w'omushoro, Yehoshafaati mwene Ahiluudi ari omuhandiiki w'ebirikubaho; <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Sheeva ari omuhandiiki; Zadoki na Abiasaari bari abanyamurwa; <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />na Iira owa Yayiri ari enganzi ya Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okutura Abaisraeli ebi Saulo yaitsize aba Gibeoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 27:21">Kub 27:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro bya Daudi hakabaho enjara okumara emyaka eshatu: Daudi yaayehanuuza ahari MUKAMA. MUKAMA yaagarukamu ati: Enjara egi eteire ahabwa Saulo n'enju ye y'enyitsi y'abantu, ahabw'okuba akaita aba Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:3-17">Yos 9:3-17</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaatuma kweta aba Gibeoni. (Aba Gibeoni abo bakaba batari b'eihanga ry'Abaisraeli, kureka bakaba bari ab'Abaamori, abaatsigaireho. N'obu Abaisraeli baarahiire kutabaita, kwonka Saulo akaba naayenda kubaita ahabw'eihato eri yaabaire ainiire Abaisraeli n'Abayuda.) <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Daudi yaabuuza aba Gibeoni ati: Mbwenu mbakorere ki? Nkaakaraba ki, mukabona kushabira obuhunguzi bwa MUKAMA omugisha? <verse eid="2SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Aba Gibeoni baamugarukamu bati: Eki turikwenda ahari Saulo n'enju ye ti feeza, nari ezaabu; kandi okwita omuntu omuri Israeli ti kyaitu. Onu yaagira ati: Eki murikwenda, nikyo ndaabakorere. <verse eid="2SA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Baagira omugabe bati: Ogwo mushaija waatucwekyereize, akacuma enaama y'okutumariraho kimwe, ngu tutagira ah'okutuura omu nsi ya Israeli yoona; <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:24">1 Sam 10:24</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 10:26">26</ref>. </char></note> mbwenu mutuhe abashaija mushanju omu batabani, tubahanikye omu maisho ga MUKAMA omuri Gibea ya Saulo owaatoorainwe MUKAMA. Omugabe yaagira ati: Niinyija kubabaha.<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Kwonka omugabe yaarokora Mefiboshesi mwene Yonasaani mutabani wa Saulo, ahabw'endahiro ei Daudi na Yonasaani mwene Saulo baarahiriraine ahari MUKAMA. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:19">1 Sam 18:19</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 3:7">2 Sam 3:7</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaatwara batabani ba Rizipa muhara wa Aya bombi, abu yaazaariire Saulo, Arumooni na Mefiboshesi, kandi n'abatabani ba Merabu muhara wa Saulo bataano, abu yaazaariire Adurieli mwene Baruzilai owa Mehola; <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />yaabahayo omu mikono y'aba Gibeoni, baabahanika omu kibungo omu maisho ga MUKAMA; boona mushanju baafeera hamwe. Baitwa omu itogyera, nibatandika kugyesha sayiri.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Rizipa muhara wa Aya yaatwara ekiguniya, yaaguma naakyeyarira aha rukiri okwiha omu itogyera okuhitsya obu enjura ya katumba yaagwire ahari egyo mitumbi; omu bunaku obwo bwona Rizipa tiyaikiriza mahungu g'omu mwanya kugizaho nyomushana, nari enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba nyekiro. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Baagambira Daudi eki Rizipa muhara wa Aya, ekinyanshunju kya Saulo, akozire. <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:10-13">1 Sam 31:10-13</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagyenda, yaiha amagufa ga Saulo n'aga Yonasaani omutabani omu bantu ba Yabeshi-gileadi, abaabaire bagaibire omu muhanda gwa Besi-shaani, ei Abafilistia baabaire babahanikire, aha izooba eri Abafilistia baitiireho Saulo omuri Giliboa. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Yaihayo amagufa ga Saulo n'aga Yonasaani omutabani, kandi baateerana n'amagufa g'ababaire bahanikirwe. <verse eid="2SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:28">Yos 18:28</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 24:25">2 Sam 24:25</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baaziika amagufa ga Saulo na Yonasaani omutabani Zeela omu nsi ya Benyamiini omu kituuro kya Kiishi ishe; baahikiiriza ebi omugabe yaabaragiire byona. Bwanyima y'ebyo Ruhanga yaabona kuhurira okushaba kwabo ahabw'ensi.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amamanzi ga Daudi n'ebi gaakozire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Abafilistia baagaruka kurwana n'Abaisraeli. Daudi yaashuuma n'abashaija be, baarwana n'Abafilistia; ku baabaire nibakirwana, Daudi yaatandika kuruha. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:18">2 Sam 21:18</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 21:20">20</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 21:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Ishubi-benobu, mwijukuru w'ebikaaka biri, ou eicumu rye ryabaire riine oburemeezi bwa shekeli z'emiringa magana ashatu, ahagatiire rurara nsya, yaayenda kwita Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 18:3">2 Sam 18:3</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 22:29">22:29</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:36">1 Bag 11:36</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:4">15:4</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:19">2 Bag 8:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 21:7">2 Bus 21:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:17">Zab 132:17</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Abishai mwene Zeruiya yaija kumuha emikono, yaarwana n'Omufilistia ogwo, yaamwita. Bwanyima engabo za Daudi baamurahiza, nibagira bati: otarigaruka kuhurura naitwe, nyentsya otakaaraaza etabaaza ya Israeli.<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:18-22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 11:29">1 Bus 11:29</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">20:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 27:11">27:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo haagaruka kubaho orugamba n'Abafilistia Gobu; Sibekai owa Husha yaita Saafu ow'omuri baijukuru b'ebikaaka. <verse eid="2SA 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:24">2 Sam 23:24</ref>. </char></note> Haagaruka haabaho orugamba n'Abafilistia Gobu; Elihanani mwene Yaare-oregimu owa Betelehemu, yaita Goliasi owa Gaasi, ou orubango rw'eicumu rye rwabaire ruri nk'empimbi ei barukiraho emyenda. <verse eid="2SA 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Bwanyima haabaho orundi rugamba Gaasi. Okwo hakaba hariyo omushaija muraingwa munonga, owaabaire aine enkumu mukaaga ahari buri ngaro, n'enkumu z'ebigyere mukaaga ahari buri kigyere, zoona makumi abiri na ina; kandi nawe akaba ari ow'omuri baijukuru b'ebikaaka. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:10">1 Sam 17:10</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 17:25">25</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 17:26">26</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 17:36">36</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 17:45">45</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaahigire Abaisraeli, Yonasaani mwene Shimei mukuru wa Daudi yaamwita. <verse eid="2SA 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Abo boona bana bakaba bari baijukuru b'ebikaaka bya Gaasi; baitwa Daudi n'abashaija be.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okusiima MUKAMA ahabw'okujunwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:1">Kur 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:4">Bir 32:4</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 5:1">Bar 5:1</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 16:7">1 Bus 16:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:2-50">Zab 18:2-50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:3">31:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 71:3">71:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:3">91:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha izooba eri MUKAMA yaajuniireho Daudi omu mikono y'abazigu be boona, n'omu mukono gwa Saulo, Daudi akagambira MUKAMA ebigambo by'ekyeshongoro eki, <verse eid="2SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:2">MUKAMA n'orukiri rwangye, orugo rwangye orugumire, kandi Omujuni wangye,<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 22:31">2 Sam 22:31</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:1">Kut 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 9:9">Zab 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 14:6">14:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 59:9">59:9</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 59:16">16</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 59:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 18:10">Enf 18:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 16:19">Yer 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:69">Luk 1:69</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:13">Heb 2:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga wangye, orukiri rwangye, ou nyesiga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">Omunaara gwangye omuraingwa, n'obuhungiro bwangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">Omujuni wangye, niiwe onkiza omwaga.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 48:1">Zab 48:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyatakira MUKAMA oshemereire kuhimbisibwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:4">Obwo nibwo ndikira abazigu bangye.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 42:7">Zab 42:7</ref>; <ref loc="JON 2:2">Yon 2:2</ref>, <ref loc="JON 2:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebingonzi bya Rufu bikanzingazinga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:5">N'emyegyemure y'okuhwerekyerera yantiinisa;<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 116:3">Zab 116:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 116:4">4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emigoye y'Okuzimu ekanzingazinga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:6">Emitego ya Rufu yantanga omu maisho.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 120:1">Zab 120:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu busaasi bwangye naayeta MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Naatakira Ruhanga wangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Yaahurira eiraka ryangye ari omuri hekalu ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">N'okurira kwangye kwahika omu matu ge.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 77:18">Zab 77:18</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 5:4">Bar 5:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ensi yaatengyeta, yaatetema;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:8">N'emisingi y'eiguru yaanyiganyiga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:8">Yaatengyetsibwa ekiniga kye.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Omwika gukaruga omu nyindo ze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:9">N'omu kanwa ke haarugamu omuriro ogurikurya busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:9">Gwayatsya amakara.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 144:5">Zab 144:5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 144:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:21">Kur 20:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi akainamya eiguru, yaashuuma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:10">Omwirima ndindindi guri ahansi y'ebigyere bye.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:3">Zab 104:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaagaruka aheekirwe kerubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:11">Yaareebwa ari aha mapapa g'omuyaga.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Akahindura omwirima obweshereko, nk'eihema erimwehinguririize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:12">N'ebicu ebikwaitse ebirimu amaizi yaabigira eky'okumusangira<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Omu kumurinkana okwabaire kuri omu maisho ge</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:13">Haarugamu amakara garikwaka.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 37:4">Yob 37:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaahindira omu iguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:14">Rukira-boona yaagamba n'eiraka rye.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 3:11">Hab 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:23">Bir 32:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaarasha emyambi ye, yaabataataanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:15">Niyo mirabyo ye mingi, yaababinga.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:8">Kur 15:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo nibwo empanga z'ahansi y'enyanja zaareebwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">N'emisingi y'ensi ekashuuruuka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">Ahabw'okukabuka kwa MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">Ahabw'okuhuuha kw'amaani okw'omwitsyo gw'omu nyindo zaawe.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 144:7">Zab 144:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yankununkirira ari ahaiguru, yankwata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:17">Yaanyiha omu maizi maingi.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Yankiza omuzigu wangye ow'amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:18">N'abo abaabaire nibaanyanga, ahakuba bakaba nibankiza amaani.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Bakampururira aha izooba ry'okureeberaho enaku;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:19">Kwonka MUKAMA yaaba obwegamo bwangye.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:8">Zab 31:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:5">118:5</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:26">2 Sam 15:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaaziinyihamu, yanta omu mwanya ogugarami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:20">Yanjuna, ahabw'okuba akaba nanshemerererwa.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 7:8">Zab 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 24:4">24:4</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:32">1 Bag 8:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA akampa ebihembo nk'okuhikiirira kwangye oku kuri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:21">Yanzimuurira nk'okushemera kw'emikono yangye oku kuri.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:19">Kut 18:19</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 8:32">Enf 8:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba nkagumira omu mihanda ya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:22">Kandi tinkacumuraga kuruga ahari Ruhanga wangye.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:30">Zab 119:30</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 119:102">102</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebiragiro bye byona bikaba biri omu maisho gangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:23">Tinkeetantaraga bi yaaragiire.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:1">Yob 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 6:9">Kut 6:9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:1">17:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaba ntaine ky'okuhanwa omu maisho ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:24">Kandi nkeerinda okushiisha.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Nikyo MUKAMA yaanyihuriire, nk'okuhikiirira kwangye oku kuri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:25">Akanzimuurira ebishemereire okushemera kw'emikono yangye omu maisho ge.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:7">Mat 5:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha munyambabazi oyeyoreka ori ow'embabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:26">Ahari ohikire oyeyoreka ori ohikire;<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Ahari oshemeire oyeyoreka ori oshemeire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:27">Aha mugomi oyeyoreka ogumire.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 72:12">Zab 72:12</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 72:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:11">Isa 2:11</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 2:12">12</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 2:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:51">Luk 1:51</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ojuna abacureezi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:28">Kwonka amaisho gaawe gari aha banyamaryo okubagarura ahansi.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 27:1">Zab 27:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 29:3">Yob 29:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eego, niiwe okongyeza etabaaza yangye, ai MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:29">Ruhanga wangye ayakira omwirima gwangye.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Eego, ahabwawe nimbaasa kurwanisa omutwe gw'engabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:30">Ahabw'okuhwerwa Ruhanga wangye nimbaasa kuguruka orugo.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:12">Zab 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 12:6">12:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 84:9">84:9</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 30:5">Enf 30:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:4">Mat 5:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga ogwo, omuhanda gwe n'oguhikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:31">Okuraganisa kwa MUKAMA kurengirwe, n'okw'amazima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:31">Niwe ngabo ekingira abamuhungiraho boona.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Mbwenu n'oha oba Ruhanga, otari MUKAMA?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:32">N'oha oba Rukiri, otari Ruhanga waitu?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 28:8">Zab 28:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga ogu n'obuhungiro bwangye obugumire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:33">Niwe ahabura abahikire omu mihanda yaabo.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:13">Bir 32:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:14">Isa 58:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Agira ebigyere byangye nk'eby'empara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:34">Anyemereza aha nengo mpamire.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 144:1">Zab 144:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ayegyesa engaro zangye okurwana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:35">Ngu emikono yangye ebaase kureega obuta bw'emiringa.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Ompaire engabo y'okujuna kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:36">Okutwaza gye kwawe kunkurize.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 4:12">Enf 4:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ompanguhiize ah'okuraba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:37">Ebigyere byangye tibyaterera.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />Nkakurata abazigu bangye, naabahwerekyereza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:38">Kandi tindagarukire okuhitsya obu baahweireho.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Naabamaraho nimbacumita, tibaabaasa kwimuka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:39">Baagwa ahansi y'ebigyere byangye.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Ahakuba okanzirika amaani g'okurwana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:40">Waagomoora abaabaire nibaija kundwanisa.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:27">Kur 23:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okareetera abazigu bangye kumpunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:41">Kandi n'abaabaire nibaanyanga naabacwekyereza.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 28:6">1 Sam 28:6</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:28">Enf 1:28</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:4">Mik 3:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baamagamaga, kwonka baabura kijuna;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:42">Baatakira MUKAMA, tiyaabagarukamu.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:43: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 7:10">Mik 7:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naabateera, naabagira omucuucu gw'ahansi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:43">Naabaribatiirira nk'ebyondo by'omu nguuto.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:44: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:1-14">2 Sam 8:1-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okankiza okurwana n'amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">Wandinda ngu mbe mukuru waago;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">Naaheerezibwa eihanga eri ntakamanyaga.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:45: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:29">Bir 33:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyamahanga baija ahi ndi nibaajura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:45">Ku bampuriire bati, ahonaaho baanyorobera.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 89:26">Zab 89:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 95:1">95:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:15">Bir 32:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abo banyamahanga bakeehwa amatsiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:46">Baaruga omu bigo byabo nibatetema.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />MUKAMA n'ohuriire; Rukiri wangye ahimbisibwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:47">Ruhanga orukiri rw'okujunwa kwangye aheebwe ekitiinisa!<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:48: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 144:2">Zab 144:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niwe Ruhanga owampooreire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:48">Akangomoorera amahanga,<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:49: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 140:1">Zab 140:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akaanyiha omu mikono y'abazigu bangye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">Eego, okanta ahaiguru y'abarikundwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">Waanyiha omu mikono y'abanyamwaga.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:50: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Zab 89:20</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 89:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam 7:12</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">1 Sam 16:12</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 16:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, ai MUKAMA, ndyakusiimira omu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:50">Nyeshongore eby'okuhimbisa eiziina ryawe.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />Omugabe ou yaataireho, amuha obusinguzi bwingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:51">Kandi ayoreka ou yaashukireho amajuta embabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:51">Niwe Daudi n'abaijukuru ebiro n'ebiro.<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Ekyeshongoro kya Daudi eky'aha muheru</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:70">Zab 78:70</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:71">71</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:8">2 Sam 7:8</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi nibyo bigambo bya Daudi eby'aha muheru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">Okuhanuura kwa Daudi mwene Yese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">Okuhanuura kw'omushaija owaatungwirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">Okuhanuura kw'owaashukirweho Ruhanga wa Yakobo amajuta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">Omuhimbi murungi wa zaaburi za Israeli.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:21">2 Pet 1:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwoyo wa MUKAMA naagambira omuriinye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:2">Ekigambo kye tikinduga ha rurimi.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 18:21">Kur 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 22:2">2 Sam 22:2</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 22:3">3</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 22:32">32</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 22:47">47</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 19:7">2 Bus 19:7</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 19:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga wa Israeli agambire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">Rukiri wa Israeli angambiire, ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">Omuntu ku ategyeka abantu omu buryo buhikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">Naategyekyera omu kutiina Ruhanga,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 4:18">Enf 4:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaakira nk'omushekye oku gujuguta omu kasheeshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">Nk'oku eizooba ryaka omu kasheeshe akataine kibunda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">Aba nk'enjura erikumeza obunyatsi omu itaka.<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />N'ekya buzima, enju yangye tikwo eri na Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Kwonka We andaganiise endagaano etarihwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Etebeekanisiibwe gye omuri byona, kandi ehamire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Tarikwija kuhikiiriza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Okuhwerwa kwangye kwona n'ebi ndikwetenga?<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Kwonka abataine Ruhanga boona baryaba nk'amahwa g'okunagwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:6">Ahakuba tigarikubaasa kukwatwa n'engaro;<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Kureka orikwenda kugakoraho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:7">Ashemereire kugakoresaho ekyoma n'orubango rw'eicumu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:7">Kandi baryabookyeza kimwe n'omuriro.<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amaziina g'amamanzi ga Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:8-39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 11:11-47">1 Bus 11:11-47</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 27:2">27:2</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 27:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aga nigo maziina g'amamanzi agu Daudi yaabaire aine; Yehoshebashebesi owa Takimooni niwe yaabaire ari mukuru omuri abo abashatu; akakwata eicumu rye, yaariitsa abantu magana munaana omurundi gumwe.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 27:4">1 Bus 27:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Owaabaire naamukurata omuri ago mamanzi ashatu ni Eleazaari mwene Dodo, mwijukuru wa Ahohi. Akaba ari hamwe na Daudi, obu baahiga Abafilistia abaabaire beeteeraniireyo kurwana, Abaisraeli bakabahunga. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Yaimuka, yaita Abafilistia okuhitsya obu omukono gwe gwaruhire, engaro ye ekaramatana na rurara; eryo izooba MUKAMA yaabaha okusingura kuhango, abandi baamugarukira ahabw'okucwijura abaitsirwe kwonka.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Kandi ogwo akaba naakuratwa Shama, mwene Ageye, owa Harari. Abafilistia bakaba bateeraniire Leehi, ahu omusiri ogwijwire enkoore gwabaire guri; abashaija boona baahunga Abafilistia; <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />kwonka we yaayemerera ahagati y'ogwo musiri, yaagurinda, yaita Abafilistia; MUKAMA yaabaha okusingura kuhango.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 22:1">1 Sam 22:1</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:18">2 Sam 5:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu igyesha abo bashaija bonshatu ab'omu mamanzi makumi ashatu bakashuuma, baashanga Daudi omu nyanga ya Adulaamu. Obwo omutwe gw'engabo z'Abafilistia gukaba gusiisiire omu ruhanga rwa Reefa; <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:4">1 Sam 22:4</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 22:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Daudi ari omu kigo, n'Abafilistia bari Betelehemu. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Daudi yaatenga, yaagira ati: Nkaabaasibwa ki hagira owampa otwizi tw'omu kiziba eriri aha irembo rya Betelehemu, ntunywa! <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Ahonaaho ago mamanzi ashatu gaayataguza omu rusiisira rw'Abafilistia, gaataha amaizi g'omuri eryo iziba rya Betelehemu, eryabaire riri aha irembo, baagatwarira Daudi; kwonka we yaayanga kuganywa, kureka yaagashuka omu maisho ga MUKAMA; <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />yaagira ati: Ai MUKAMA, rubuuza nyowe okukora eki. Nimbaasa kunywa eshagama y'abashaija abaayoga amagara gaabo? Ekyo nikyo yaayangiire kuganywa. Ebyo nibyo ago mamanzi ashatu gaakozire.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Kandi Abishai mukuru wa Yoabu mwene Zeruiya niwe yaabaire ari mukuru w'abo makumi ashatu. Akakwata eicumu rye, yaarwana n'abashaija magana ashatu, yaabaita, yaarangaanwa nk'abo abashatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Omuri abo makumi ashatu niwe yaakizire kurangaanwa, akahinduka mukuru waabo; kwonka tiyaahika hari abo abashatu.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:18">2 Sam 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 20:23">20:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada owa Kabuzieli, owaabaire ari emanzi, akakora eby'amaani; yaita beene Arieli babiri aba Moabu. Kandi aha izooba rimwe omu biro by'ebirika akashuuma, yaitira entare omu kiina. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Kandi yaita Omunyamisri murungi ahamaisho. Omunyamisri ogwo akaba aine eicumu omu ngaro, kwonka Benaaya yaamushuumira n'enkoni, yaamusikura eicumu omu ngaro, yaarimwitsa. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Ebyo nibyo Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada yaakozire, akarangaanwa nk'abo abashatu ab'amaani. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Yaarangaanwa omuri abo makumi ashatu, kwonka tiyaahika hari bari abashatu. Daudi yaamuhindura omukuru w'abarinzi be. <verse eid="2SA 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:18">2 Sam 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 27:7">1 Bus 27:7</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 27:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Asaheeli murumuna wa Yoabu akaba ari omwe ahari abo makumi ashatu, na Elihanani mwene Doodo owa Betelehemu, <verse eid="2SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Shama owa Harodi, Elika owa Harodi, <verse eid="2SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Helezi owa Paluti, Iira mwene Ikishi owa Tekoa, <verse eid="2SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:18">Yos 21:18</ref>. </char></note> Abiezeeri owa Anatoosi, Mebunai owa Huusha, <verse eid="2SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Zalumooni owa Ahohi, Maharai owa Netofa, <verse eid="2SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:28">Yos 18:28</ref>. </char></note> Helebu mwene Baana owa Netofa, Itayi, mwene Ribai owa Gibea eya Benyamiini, <verse eid="2SA 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:30">Yos 24:30</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 27:14">1 Bus 27:14</ref>. </char></note> Benaaya owa Piratooni, Hidai ow'omu tugyera twa Gaashi, <verse eid="2SA 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Abialiboni owa Arubasi, Azimaveesi owa Bahurimu, <verse eid="2SA 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Eliahuba owa Shalibooni, beene Yasheni, Yonasaani, <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />Shama owa Harari, Ahiamu mwene Sharari owa Arari, <verse eid="2SA 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:3">2 Sam 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:12">15:12</ref>. </char></note> Elifeleti mwene Ahasibai mwijukuru wa Maaka, Eliamu mwene Ahisofeeli owa Giilo, <verse eid="2SA 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Hezero owa Karumeeli, Parai owa Arubi, <verse eid="2SA 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Igaali mwene Nasani owa Zooba, Baani owa Gaadi, <verse eid="2SA 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Zeleki Omuamoni, Naharai owa Beeroosi, Yoabu mwene Zeruiya, <verse eid="2SA 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:26">2 Sam 20:26</ref>. </char></note> Iira owa Ituri, Garebu owa Ituri, <verse eid="2SA 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:3">2 Sam 11:3</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 11:6">6</ref>. </char></note> na Uriya Omuhiiti boona makumi ashatu na mushanju.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Ekibi kya Daudi eky'okubara Abaisraeli n'Abayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1-25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 21:1-28">1 Bus 21:1-28</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 27:23">27:23</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 27:24">24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA yaagaruka, yaagirira Israeli ekiniga, yaimutsya Daudi kubakora kubi, naagira ati: Gyenda obare Abaisraeli n'Abayuda. <verse eid="2SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:10">2 Sam 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 24:15">24:15</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaagira Yoabu omukuru w'eihe rye, ou yaabaire aine, ati: Gyenda orabe omu nganda za Israeli zoona, okuruga Daani okuhika Beeri-sheba, mubare abantu, mbone kumanya omubaro gwabo. <verse eid="2SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:11">Bir 1:11</ref>. </char></note> Yoabu yaagira omugabe ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ayongyere aha bantu okukira oku bari emirundi igana, kandi omugabe akyereebere. Beitu shi, Nyakusinga omugabe, ahabw'enki nooshemerererwa ekintu ekyo? <verse eid="2SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Kwonka ekigambo ky'omugabe kyakiza ebya Yoabu n'abakuru b'engabo ze amaani. Bwanyima Yoabu n'abo bakuru b'engabo baaruga omu maisho g'omugabe, baaza kubara Abaisraeli. <verse eid="2SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:32">Kub 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 2:36">Bir 2:36</ref>. </char></note> Baayambuka Yorudani, baatandikira omuri Aroeli, n'omu rurembo orwabaire ruri ahagati y'oruhita, baaza Gaadi, baagumizamu, baahika Yazeri. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:28">Yos 19:28</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baahika Gileadi, na Kadeshi ey'omu nsi y'Abahiiti; bwanyima baahika Daani, baagumizamu, baaziguuruka baahika Sidoni; <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:3">Yos 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 19:29">19:29</ref>. </char></note> okuruga aho baahika omu kigo kya Tuuro, n'omu ndembo zoona ez'Abahiivi n'Abanyakanaani. Bwanyima baaza omuri Negebu eya Yuda, baahika Beeri-sheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Ku baaherize kubara omu nsi yoona, baagaruka Yerusaalemu, bamazire ameezi mwenda n'ebiro makumi abiri. <verse eid="2SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Yoabu yaaha omugabe omubaro gw'abantu abu yaabazire; omuri Israeli hakaba harimu abashaija amamanzi enkwata-rurara obusiriira munaana; kandi Abayuda bakaba bari obusiriira butaano.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okuha Daudi n'Abaisraeli ekifubiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 24:5">1 Sam 24:5</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 12:13">2 Sam 12:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ku yaaherize kubara abantu, omutima gwe gwamushinja; yaagira MUKAMA ati: Ncumwire munonga ahabw'ekyo eki nkozire. Kwonka mbwenu ninkweshengyereza, ai MUKAMA, iha aha mwiru waawe okutahikiirira; ahakuba ndengyesereize, naakora eky'obufa-mutima. <verse eid="2SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:13">1 Sam 13:13</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 22:5">22:5</ref>. </char></note> Daudi ku yaimukire omu kasheeshe, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaizira nabi Gaadi, omuhanuuzi wa Daudi, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />Gyenda ogire Daudi oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba, naagira ati: Naakuha ebintu bishatu, oiheho kimwe, mbe nikyo naakukora. <verse eid="2SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Atyo Gaadi yaija ahari Daudi, yaakimugambira; yaamugira ati: Ahari ebi bishatu ihaho kimwe, ensi yaawe okuteerwa enjara emyaka mushanju; nari okuguma noohunga abazigu baawe bakubingire okumara ameezi ashatu; nari ensi yaawe okujuumikirwa orufu okumara ebiro bishatu. Mbwenu teekateeka, ongambire eki ndaagarukyemu Ontumire. <verse eid="2SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:156">Zab 119:156</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaagira Gaadi ati: Naashobererwa kimwe; ka tugwe omu mikono ya MUKAMA, ahakuba embabazi ze ni nyingi; ndekye kugwa omu mikono y'abantu.<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 27:24">1 Bus 27:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA yaajuumikiza Israeli orufu, okwiha omuri ako kasheeshe okuhitsya aha bunaku obutairweho; haafa abantu obukumi mushanju, okuruga Daani okuhika Beeri-sheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:6">Kut 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:13">Kur 12:13</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 12:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:11">1 Sam 15:11</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:35">2 Bag 19:35</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:1">2 Bus 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:13">Yoel 2:13</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="JON 3:10">Yon 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:23">Byak 12:23</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka maraika ku yaabangiire Yerusaalemu omukono kugicwekyereza, MUKAMA yaayegarukamu ahabw'ako kabi, yaagira maraika owaabaire naacwekyereza abantu ati: Ekyo nikimara. Banguura omukono. Obwo maraika wa MUKAMA akaba ari haihi n'embuga ya Arauna Omuyebusi. <verse eid="2SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Daudi ku yaareebire maraika owaabaire naita abantu, yaagira MUKAMA ati: Reeba, niinye ncumwire, nkashiisha mononga; mbwenu entaama ezi zo zikozire ki? Ninkweshengyereza, omukono gwawe gube niinye gwarwanisa n'enju ya tata.<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhonga kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Eryo izooba Gaadi yaija ahari Daudi, yaamugira ati: Inamuka, oyombekyere MUKAMA eitambiro aha mbuga ya Arauna Omuyebusi. <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Atyo Daudi yainamuka, ahabw'ekigambo kya Gaadi eki MUKAMA amuragiire. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Arauna ku yaanagire amaisho, yaareeba omugabe n'abagaragwa be nibaija ah'ari; yaashohora, yainama omu maisho g'omugabe; <verse eid="2SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:48">Kub 16:48</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 16:50">50</ref>. </char></note> Arauna yaabuuza ati: N'enki ekyareeta mukama wangye omugabe aha mwiru we? Daudi yaamugarukamu ati: Naareetwa okugura embuga yaawe, kwombekyera MUKAMA eitambiro, ngu orufu rurugye omu bantu. <verse eid="2SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Arauna yaagira Daudi ati: Mukama wangye omugabe atware eki arikwenda kyona, akihongye; reeba ente ez'ekitambo ky'okwotsya nzizi, n'ebihuuzo n'emigamba y'ente mubiihemu enku. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:11">Bir 33:11</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo byona, Nyakusinga, nyowe Arauna naabiha omugabe. Yaagaruka yaagira omugabe ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akwikirize. <verse eid="2SA 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Kwonka omugabe yaagira Arauna ati: Ngaaha; buzimazima niinyija kubigura naiwe, nkuhe obuguzi bwabyo. Tindikwija kuhongyera MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye ebitambo by'okwotsya, ebi ntaheereire byangye. Atyo Daudi yaagura egyo mbuga n'ezo nte shekeli z'efeeza makumi ataano. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:14">2 Sam 21:14</ref>. </char></note> Daudi yaayombekyerayo MUKAMA eitambiro, yaatamba ebitambo by'okwotsya n'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. Atyo MUKAMA yaahurira ebi yaayeshengyereziibwe ahabw'ensi; orufu rwaruga omuri Israeli.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>